dding.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":8032,"PostDate":1163919611,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I haven't contact any photographers, yet - but I asked my WC for a list of ones they've used in the past, and here was her response ...<br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.robertoaceves.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.robertoaceves.com\/<\/a><br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.francogonzalez.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.francogonzalez.com\/<\/a><br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.carlosmelnik.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.carlosmelnik.com\/<\/a><br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.leticiaalarconphotography.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.leticiaal...hotography.com\/<\/a><br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.maggiehallahan.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.maggiehallahan.com\/<\/a><br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.fairy-tale-wedding.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.fairy-tale-wedding.com\/<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/anns-annr-las-caletas-dreams-pv-hawaii-review-looooooong-6068\/'>Ann's Caletas Wedding & Hawaii Honeymoon Review<\/a><br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.leighmillerphotography.com\/darkroom\/share\/?n=ann_paul'>Our Caletas Wedding Slideshow (by Leigh Miller)<\/a><br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.onetruemedia.com\/shared?p=31de360c85cec8376c35a5&skin_id=701&utm_source=otm&utm_medium=image'>Our Caletas Wedding Video<\/a>","Email":"annkherrick@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"76.16.7.43","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1161392880,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206863.jpg?_r=1429384252","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LCBride2007","Id":206863,"Name":"LCBride2007","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":715,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"458ce73b2b379811d23d8ac44134bcf8","RawContent":"I notice that the list of photographers at the beginning of this thread was taken from our website. It&#039;s great that you are giving these photographers more exposure! However, the list you gave is incomplete. For the rest of the list, go to &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.strayweddings.com\/find_photo.php\"&gt;www.strayweddings.com\/find_photo.php&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n Remember, there are many photographers from other areas around Mexico that are more than willing to travel to Puerto Vallarta for your wedding. If you like their work, give them a call or send them an e-mail.","Attachments":[],"Id":9117,"PostDate":1164708730,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I notice that the list of photographers at the beginning of this thread was taken from our website. It's great that you are giving these photographers more exposure! However, the list you gave is incomplete. For the rest of the list, go to <a href='http:\/\/www.strayweddings.com\/find_photo.php' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>www.strayweddings.com\/find_photo.php<\/a><br \/> <br \/> Remember, there are many photographers from other areas around Mexico that are more than willing to travel to Puerto Vallarta for your wedding. If you like their work, give them a call or send them an e-mail.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jsnider@strayweddings.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1163805000,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206913.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Stray","Id":206913,"Name":"Stray","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":715,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a31db076aca3a12bd716237d762b32ee","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;akh&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I haven&#039;t contact any photographers, yet - but I asked my WC for a list of ones they&#039;ve used in the past, and here was her response ...\n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.robertoaceves.com\/\"&gt;Sitio suspendido&lt;\/a&gt;\n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.francogonzalez.com\/\"&gt;Franco Gonzalez, Photographer in Puerto Vallarta | Weddings and Events Photography Puerto Vallarta Mexico&lt;\/a&gt;\n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.carlosmelnik.com\/\"&gt;Carlos Melnik, Fotografo en Puerto Vallarta \/ Fotografia para Bodas y Eventos en Puerto Vallarta \/Photographer in Puerto Vallarta \/ Weddings and Events Photography Puerto Vallarta Mexico Fotografos de Bodas en Puerto vallarta&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.leticiaalarconphotography.com\/\"&gt;index.jpg&lt;\/a&gt;\n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.maggiehallahan.com\/\"&gt;Maggie Hallahan 415-305-7553&lt;\/a&gt;\n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.fairy-tale-wedding.com\/\"&gt;fairy-tale-wedding.com&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;It looks like I already posted these - this is the list from my WC in Puerto Vallarta. Since I&#039;ve been searching, I&#039;ve also come up with a few more. Many (all?) of these aren&#039;t located in PV - but will travel.\n \n Fairy Tale Wedding (Gaia Mikosza) - &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.fairy-tale-wedding.com\/\"&gt;fairy-tale-wedding.com&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n Story By Photo (Gino and Heather Lucadamo) - &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.storybyphoto.com\"&gt;Story by Photo is the worlds leading Destination Wedding Photographer also serving Arizona, California, Florida and New York&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n Sergio - &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.sergiophotographer.com\"&gt;Sergio Photographer&lt;\/a&gt; (referred by Sol Tamargo)\n \n Elizabeth Medina - &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.elizabethmedinaphotography.com\/\"&gt;Mexico Wedding Photographer, Elizabeth Medina, destination wedding photography, Merida, Yucatan, Mexico&lt;\/a&gt; (referred by a few people, including Juan!)\n \n Art of Light Photography - &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.artoflightphoto.com\/\"&gt;The Art Of Light Photography&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n Trista Lerit - &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.tristalerit.com\/\"&gt;Trista Lerit Photography: Modern Edgy Wedding Photojournalist based in Orange County, California.&lt;\/a&gt; (newer, but had great work, recent Knottie!)","Attachments":[],"Id":9140,"PostDate":1164743115,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>akh<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I haven't contact any photographers, yet - but I asked my WC for a list of ones they've used in the past, and here was her response ...<br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.robertoaceves.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Sitio suspendido<\/a><br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.francogonzalez.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Franco Gonzalez, Photographer in Puerto Vallarta | Weddings and Events Photography Puerto Vallarta Mexico<\/a><br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.carlosmelnik.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Carlos Melnik, Fotografo en Puerto Vallarta \/ Fotografia para Bodas y Eventos en Puerto Vallarta \/Photographer in Puerto Vallarta \/ Weddings and Events Photography Puerto Vallarta Mexico Fotografos de Bodas en Puerto vallarta<\/a><br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.leticiaalarconphotography.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>index.jpg<\/a><br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.maggiehallahan.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Maggie Hallahan 415-305-7553<\/a><br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.fairy-tale-wedding.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>fairy-tale-wedding.com<\/a><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>It looks like I already posted these - this is the list from my WC in Puerto Vallarta. Since I've been searching, I've also come up with a few more. Many (all?) of these aren't located in PV - but will travel.<br \/> <br \/> Fairy Tale Wedding (Gaia Mikosza) - <a href='http:\/\/www.fairy-tale-wedding.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>fairy-tale-wedding.com<\/a><br \/> <br \/> Story By Photo (Gino and Heather Lucadamo) - <a href='http:\/\/www.storybyphoto.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Story by Photo is the worlds leading Destination Wedding Photographer also serving Arizona, California, Florida and New York<\/a><br \/> <br \/> Sergio - <a href='http:\/\/www.sergiophotographer.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Sergio Photographer<\/a> (referred by Sol Tamargo)<br \/> <br \/> Elizabeth Medina - <a href='http:\/\/www.elizabethmedinaphotography.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Mexico Wedding Photographer, Elizabeth Medina, destination wedding photography, Merida, Yucatan, Mexico<\/a> (referred by a few people, including Juan!)<br \/> <br \/> Art of Light Photography - <a href='http:\/\/www.artoflightphoto.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>The Art Of Light Photography<\/a><br \/> <br \/> Trista Lerit - <a href='http:\/\/www.tristalerit.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Trista Lerit Photography: Modern Edgy Wedding Photojournalist based in Orange County, California.<\/a> (newer, but had great work, recent Knottie!)\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/anns-annr-las-caletas-dreams-pv-hawaii-review-looooooong-6068\/'>Ann's Caletas Wedding & Hawaii Honeymoon Review<\/a><br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.leighmillerphotography.com\/darkroom\/share\/?n=ann_paul'>Our Caletas Wedding Slideshow (by Leigh Miller)<\/a><br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.onetruemedia.com\/shared?p=31de360c85cec8376c35a5&skin_id=701&utm_source=otm&utm_medium=image'>Our Caletas Wedding Video<\/a>","Email":"annkherrick@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"76.16.7.43","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1161392880,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206863.jpg?_r=1429384252","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LCBride2007","Id":206863,"Name":"LCBride2007","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":715,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"18cea693c092e1f10b57ed8de641bdf7","RawContent":"I just noticed that &amp;quot;Paulina Ulloa&amp;quot; is listed as the photog on The Dazzeling Details website. I tried to goggle her but couldn&#039;t find her direct info. I&#039;ll try looking into it some more. It&#039;s possible, however, that she may work exclusively with them.\n \n Here&#039;s a link to the website:\n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.thedazzlingdetails.com\/gallery.php?w=70\"&gt;Puerto Vallarta Wedding Coordinator - The Dazzling Details&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":10764,"PostDate":1165492939,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I just noticed that \"Paulina Ulloa\" is listed as the photog on The Dazzeling Details website. I tried to goggle her but couldn't find her direct info. I'll try looking into it some more. It's possible, however, that she may work exclusively with them.<br \/> <br \/> Here's a link to the website:<br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.thedazzlingdetails.com\/gallery.php?w=70' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Puerto Vallarta Wedding Coordinator - The Dazzling Details<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"Photo by <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.monicamartinphotography.com\/blog'>www.monicamartinphotography.com\/blog<\/a><br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f128\/amyhs-planning-galore-24132\/index10.html'>Planning Pics!<\/a> <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/amyhs-puerto-vallarta-wedding-more-review-works-25255\/index4.html'>PV and Wedding Review<\/a><strong class='bbc'><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/picasaweb.google.com\/amyhmartin\/ProfessionalWeddingPictures?authkey=w0DgS3ao1sI#'>Pro Pics (1)<\/a>; <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/picasaweb.google.com\/amyhmartin\/ProfessionalWeddingPictures2?authkey=vbG3xUMVk1s#'>Pro Pics (2)<\/a><\/strong> <strong class='bbc'>By Nataly Lemus Photography and Rodolfo Arpia Photography<\/strong> <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/natalylemusphoto.blogspot.com\/2008\/07\/amy-hanssel-married.html'>Teaser Pro Pics from Nataly Lemus Photogaphy<\/a><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.arpiaphotoblog.com\/2008\/07\/puerto-vallarta-destination-wedding_3102.html'>Teaser Pro Pics from Rodolfo Arpia Photography<\/a>","Email":"amyhmartin@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.119.192.139","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1162172040,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206875.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":285,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amyh","Id":206875,"Name":"amyh","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":715,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"baa6ecdbd6bf848b42f8c5699a2d2dcc","RawContent":"Just wanted to say hi and let you know that I&#039;m also a photographer in PV. Have been here just over a year; am originally from NYC.\n \n You can view my work at &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.xinefoto.com\"&gt;xinefoto.com&lt;\/a&gt; my contact info is on the last slide\/image. My style has an emphasis on photojournalism\/documentary, but I am also skilled in more traditional portraiture.\n \n I&#039;m also here to answer whatever I can about PV.","Attachments":[],"Id":11003,"PostDate":1165658269,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Just wanted to say hi and let you know that I'm also a photographer in PV. Have been here just over a year; am originally from NYC.<br \/> <br \/> You can view my work at <a href='http:\/\/www.xinefoto.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>xinefoto.com<\/a> my contact info is on the last slide\/image. My style has an emphasis on photojournalism\/documentary, but I am also skilled in more traditional portraiture.<br \/> <br \/> I'm also here to answer whatever I can about PV.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"xinefoto@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1165657112,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206950.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"fotogal","Id":206950,"Name":"fotogal","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":715,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dea251238f6f047f2cc24383f4f3f20a","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;fotogal&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Just wanted to say hi and let you know that I&#039;m also a photographer in PV. Have been here just over a year; am originally from NYC.\n \n You can view my work at &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.xinefoto.com;\"&gt;www.xinefoto.com;&lt;\/a&gt; my contact info is on the last slide\/image. My style has an emphasis on photojournalism\/documentary, but I am also skilled in more traditional portraiture.\n \n I&#039;m also here to answer whatever I can about PV.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Thank you. Do you mind posting a general price list?","Attachments":[],"Id":11324,"PostDate":1165920626,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>fotogal<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Just wanted to say hi and let you know that I'm also a photographer in PV. Have been here just over a year; am originally from NYC.<br \/> <br \/> You can view my work at <a href='http:\/\/www.xinefoto.com;' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>www.xinefoto.com;<\/a> my contact info is on the last slide\/image. My style has an emphasis on photojournalism\/documentary, but I am also skilled in more traditional portraiture.<br \/> <br \/> I'm also here to answer whatever I can about PV.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Thank you. Do you mind posting a general price list?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"Photo by <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.monicamartinphotography.com\/blog'>www.monicamartinphotography.com\/blog<\/a><br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f128\/amyhs-planning-galore-24132\/index10.html'>Planning Pics!<\/a> <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/amyhs-puerto-vallarta-wedding-more-review-works-25255\/index4.html'>PV and Wedding Review<\/a><strong class='bbc'><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/picasaweb.google.com\/amyhmartin\/ProfessionalWeddingPictures?authkey=w0DgS3ao1sI#'>Pro Pics (1)<\/a>; <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/picasaweb.google.com\/amyhmartin\/ProfessionalWeddingPictures2?authkey=vbG3xUMVk1s#'>Pro Pics (2)<\/a><\/strong> <strong class='bbc'>By Nataly Lemus Photography and Rodolfo Arpia Photography<\/strong> <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/natalylemusphoto.blogspot.com\/2008\/07\/amy-hanssel-married.html'>Teaser Pro Pics from Nataly Lemus Photogaphy<\/a><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.arpiaphotoblog.com\/2008\/07\/puerto-vallarta-destination-wedding_3102.html'>Teaser Pro Pics from Rodolfo Arpia Photography<\/a>","Email":"amyhmartin@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.119.192.139","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1162172040,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206875.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":285,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amyh","Id":206875,"Name":"amyh","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":715,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","