":"<strong>Edited by veryvalentine, 06 May 2015 - 07:07 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1430968069,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9b7374ac6c7bceb48dab2fec2e7cd477","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I am seriously legit torn...like I can&#039;t decide. &amp;nbsp;I can see why you are having a difficult time deciding. &amp;nbsp;I do really love the second dress just slightly more. &amp;nbsp; It makes your waist area look sooo tiny. &amp;nbsp; The other one is stunning as well...it&#039;s actually very similar to my dress. &amp;nbsp;I mean, there is no wrong decision here. &amp;nbsp;You look stunning in both. &amp;nbsp;I don&#039;t know if I helped. &amp;nbsp;lol &amp;nbsp;but I&#039;m slightly leaning towards dress #2. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895593,"PostDate":1430968042,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am seriously legit torn...like I can't decide. \u00a0I can see why you are having a difficult time deciding. \u00a0I do really love the second dress just slightly more. \u00a0 It makes your waist area look sooo tiny. \u00a0 The other one is stunning as well...it's actually very similar to my dress. \u00a0I mean, there is no wrong decision here. \u00a0You look stunning in both. \u00a0I don't know if I helped. \u00a0lol \u00a0but I'm slightly leaning towards dress #2. \u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10747;