{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":3,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":451,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1887365,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":282234,"Name":"LeighC","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1424804653,"LastPoster":{"Id":282234,"Name":"LeighC","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":2,"Preview":{"Id":1898708,"PostDate":1434505662,"PostContent":"@AllieH \u00a0 Thanks for the reply.....if there's no other current brides there, maybe that just mean...","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread: \u00a0\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79284-leighcs-planning-thread-april-9-2016\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79284-leighcs-planning-thread-april-9-2016\/<\/a>","Email":"lcampbe8@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.250.56.118","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424802262,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"LeighC","Id":282234,"Name":"LeighC","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.250.56.118","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78838,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a62070c8b6326afbd14f9b33d345d1cc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I noticed that the last thread for El Dorado Seaside Suites is a bit dated, so I thought I&#039;d start a new one! &amp;nbsp;I just booked an April 2016 wedding with the resort, and I&#039;m so excited to start planning. &amp;nbsp;We have about 60 people on the guest list, and it looks like most will be able to come!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If anyone has tips for timing of the ceremony, cocktails (which are 2 hour packages), and reception (4hours), let me know! &amp;nbsp;I have a 3:00 ceremony as of now, but I&#039;m thinking about moving it back to 4:00 and just using one hour for cocktails.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1887365,"PostDate":1424804653,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I noticed that the last thread for El Dorado Seaside Suites is a bit dated, so I thought I'd start a new one! \u00a0I just booked an April 2016 wedding with the resort, and I'm so excited to start planning. \u00a0We have about 60 people on the guest list, and it looks like most will be able to come!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If anyone has tips for timing of the ceremony, cocktails (which are 2 hour packages), and reception (4hours), let me know! \u00a0I have a 3:00 ceremony as of now, but I'm thinking about moving it back to 4:00 and just using one hour for cocktails.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy planning!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread: \u00a0\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79284-leighcs-planning-thread-april-9-2016\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79284-leighcs-planning-thread-april-9-2016\/<\/a>","Email":"lcampbe8@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.250.56.118","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424802262,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"LeighC","Id":282234,"Name":"LeighC","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"73.207.141.225","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78838,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a2926cb0326c48e6bc26126d0d89ee78","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;hi there! so exciting - as you noticed it&#039;s been a while since we&#039;ve had an EDSS bride around. You may want to check out the Generations or the EDR threads for the cocktail\/reception info. the official EDR thread does have the banquet kit and event info there too. link in my signature. hope that helps!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1887415,"PostDate":1424819111,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>hi there! so exciting - as you noticed it's been a while since we've had an EDSS bride around. You may want to check out the Generations or the EDR threads for the cocktail\/reception info. the official EDR thread does have the banquet kit and event info there too. link in my signature. hope that helps!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/73076-official-el-dorado-royaleel-dorado-casitas-royale-thread\/'>Official El Dorado Royale\/El Dorado Casitas Royale Thread<\/a>\u00a0<---check here for all info about EDR\/EDCR<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'>Wright Travel Agency<\/a> <--for all your Destination Wedding needs! Contact the experts and reduce your stress.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/5182-el-dorado-royale-edr-brides-post-here\/'>El Dorado Royale Brides Thread<\/a> <---come chat with other EDR brides<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/69372-allie-hs-edr-rm-mexico-11-5-2012-planning-thread\/'>AllieH's EDR 11-5-2012 Planning Thread<\/a> <--because it was so awesome","Email":"allisonmoore817@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.20.174.181","GroupId":55,"GroupName":"Resort\/Area Ambassadors","JoinDate":1309657880,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241884.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AllieH","Id":241884,"Name":"AllieH","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.229.149.116","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78838,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"37afce15c529419a4b7e99021715a4aa","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"AllieH\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks for the reply.....if there&#039;s no other current brides there, maybe that just means they&#039;ll be EXTRA &amp;nbsp;accommodating for me :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;ll keep an eye on the EDR threads for the basic info. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898708,"PostDate":1434505662,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"241884\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/241884-allieh\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">AllieH<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks for the reply.....if there's no other current brides there, maybe that just means they'll be EXTRA \u00a0accommodating for me <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'll keep an eye on the EDR threads for the basic info. \u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread: \u00a0\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79284-leighcs-planning-thread-april-9-2016\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79284-leighcs-planning-thread-april-9-2016\/<\/a>","Email":"lcampbe8@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.250.56.118","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424802262,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"LeighC","Id":282234,"Name":"LeighC","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"78838","Title":"El Dorado Seaside Suites 2016 Brides","LastPostDate":1434505662},"Pages":{"TotalItems":3,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
