{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":32,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":1393,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1880197,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":268835,"Name":"travelgal78","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268835.jpg?_r=1391394238","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1418354145,"LastPoster":{"Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":2,"Preview":{"Id":1880197,"PostDate":1418354145,"PostContent":"Hi Gals! \u00a0 We are only 95 days from our wedding! I feel like this year is flying by...getting so...","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#00ffff;\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;\"><span style=\"font-family:'lucida sans unicode', 'lucida grande', sans-serif;\">*~Leslie~*<\/span><\/span><\/span> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/>","Email":"ltalbott78@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.88.142.22","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1366599591,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268835.jpg?_r=1391394238","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"travelgal78","Id":268835,"Name":"travelgal78","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.88.141.92","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78472,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"964e6bf3d71f3555722c7153d6b3e99d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Gals!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We are only 95 days from our wedding! I feel like this year is flying by...getting so excited!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Anyways, fianc\u00e9 and I are trying to figure out an alternative to the traditional unity candle or sand ceremony. We are considering writing letters to each other and placing them into a tequila bottle to be opened on our 5th anniversary (similar to the wine box ceremony but with a Mexico twist). We would then do a shot at the end to celebrate.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thoughts? Lame or cute? Would love to hear what other DW brides think! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880197,"PostDate":1418354145,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Gals!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are only 95 days from our wedding! I feel like this year is flying by...getting so excited!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Anyways, fianc\u00e9 and I are trying to figure out an alternative to the traditional unity candle or sand ceremony. We are considering writing letters to each other and placing them into a tequila bottle to be opened on our 5th anniversary (similar to the wine box ceremony but with a Mexico twist). We would then do a shot at the end to celebrate.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thoughts? Lame or cute? Would love to hear what other DW brides think! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#00ffff;\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;\"><span style=\"font-family:'lucida sans unicode', 'lucida grande', sans-serif;\">*~Leslie~*<\/span><\/span><\/span> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/>","Email":"ltalbott78@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.88.142.22","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1366599591,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268835.jpg?_r=1391394238","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"travelgal78","Id":268835,"Name":"travelgal78","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.115.239.74","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78472,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7abbaea992d7662f77a4b17e0b37b97d","RawContent":"I couldn&#039;t help but laugh as I pictured my mother&#039;s face. I think it&#039;s cool and very different. If that&#039;s what you want to do, I think you should. Perfect way to start the party for a fun couple. I love the message in a bottle as well. I want to do something similar by having my guests write us well wishes at the reception for us to read on our 1 year anniversary.","Attachments":[],"Id":1880198,"PostDate":1418354578,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I couldn't help but laugh as I pictured my mother's face. I think it's cool and very different. If that's what you want to do, I think you should. Perfect way to start the party for a fun couple. I love the message in a bottle as well. I want to do something similar by having my guests write us well wishes at the reception for us to read on our 1 year anniversary. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"So far 41 guests + bride and groom + 10 kids = 95 room nights.    Focused on planning without stressing.","Email":"bush.chanel@gmail.com","IpAddress":"170.115.248.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401302870,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"TheBHolders","Id":278146,"Name":"TheBHolders","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78472,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ddd55c5d7095cf8099701ee1a74d7c89","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I think that is a great idea!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Since my bachelorette party I am 100% off shots, but if I wasn&#039;t that is totally something I would do!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I think all the guests should do one too - or atleast the bridal party!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My fiance&#039;s mom mentioned working on a time capsule for people to add too that we can&#039;t open for 5 years but unsure where that is at.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880199,"PostDate":1418357217,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I think that is a great idea!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Since my bachelorette party I am 100% off shots, but if I wasn't that is totally something I would do!<\/p>\n<p>I think all the guests should do one too - or atleast the bridal party!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My fiance's mom mentioned working on a time capsule for people to add too that we can't open for 5 years but unsure where that is at.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399428602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.53.250.35","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78472,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3bcdeb33142cf10692e291a227795afa","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m with @[member=\"TheBHolders\"], except I think it would be my dad who would want to kill me (my mom would probably take a shot too!) &amp;nbsp; Since you&#039;re even suggesting it, it sounds like your family\/guests are way more fun than mine are, so in that case I think it&#039;s an adorable idea--really different and memorable! &amp;nbsp;All your guests will go around for months telling everyone they know \"I was at a wedding where the couple did shots at the &#039;altar&#039;!\"&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880204,"PostDate":1418388976,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm with @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278146\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278146-thebholders\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TheBHolders<\/span><\/a>, except I think it would be my dad who would want to kill me (my mom would probably take a shot too!) \u00a0 Since you're even suggesting it, it sounds like your family\/guests are way more fun than mine are, so in that case I think it's an adorable idea--really different and memorable! \u00a0All your guests will go around for months telling everyone they know \"I was at a wedding where the couple did shots at the 'altar'!\"<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rachelia160@aim.com","IpAddress":"66.61.104.237","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1388731897,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275855.jpg?_r=1431444128","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"rachelia160","Id":275855,"Name":"rachelia160","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.99.18.219","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78472,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e478ce3b1e8e77684428107a3be01163","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I think that&#039;s super cute.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880209,"PostDate":1418390181,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I think that's super cute.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"robynbrooke81@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.99.18.219","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403547389,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278661.jpg?_r=1404161707","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jeffandrobyn","Id":278661,"Name":"jeffandrobyn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"190.167.73.142","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78472,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"66c43dfea4120e72d726a9ca7d52a716","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;One of the best weddings I ever attended started off with tequila shots!!! People still talk about how much FUN they had - years later.....it&#039;s legendary :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy deciding and all the best with the rest - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-h-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpf1\/t31.0-8\/472043_10151179284184487_1208052790_o.jpg\" alt=\"472043_10151179284184487_1208052790_o.jp\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....now Let&#039;s Get this Party Started!!! weeeeee&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-a-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xfa1\/t31.0-8\/10498204_10152558963544487_7865765403738280307_o.jpg\" alt=\"10498204_10152558963544487_7865765403738\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880219,"PostDate":1418394812,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>One of the best weddings I ever attended started off with tequila shots!!! People still talk about how much FUN they had - years later.....it's legendary <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy deciding and all the best with the rest - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-h-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpf1\/t31.0-8\/472043_10151179284184487_1208052790_o.jpg\" alt=\"472043_10151179284184487_1208052790_o.jp\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....now Let's Get this Party Started!!! weeeeee<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-a-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xfa1\/t31.0-8\/10498204_10152558963544487_7865765403738280307_o.jpg\" alt=\"10498204_10152558963544487_7865765403738\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280210660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.252.52.125","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78472,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"23365044b62a7aed9393600faed238b2","RawContent":"[quote name=\"travelgal78\" post=\"1880197\" timestamp=\"1418354145\"]\nHi Gals!\n\nWe are only 95 days from our wedding! I feel like this year is flying by...getting so excited!!\n\nAnyways, fianc\u00e9 and I are trying to figure out an alternative to the traditional unity candle or sand ceremony. We are considering writing letters to each other and placing them into a tequila bottle to be opened on our 5th anniversary (similar to the wine box ceremony but with a Mexico twist). We would then do a shot at the end to celebrate.\n\nThoughts? Lame or cute? Would love to hear what other DW brides think! :)[\/quote]This is a cute Idea travelgal78,\n\nActually one of my past bride what they did at the ceremony instead of a sand cereomy was a margarita on the rocks.  we prepared everything that needed to go in the margarita and just before preparing it the both mothers handed them the tray to them just before the cereomony. it was so cute and different!!\n[img]https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-h-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpa1\/v\/t35.0-12\/10856004_10204684495185205_1881777807_o.jpg?oh=764a8922eef3f5fb33a4e02c33d7c5cf&amp;amp;oe=548DED8D&amp;amp;__gda__=1418585440_cbd772ab534220b794a846e0fd2b5bf9[\/img]\n\nHappy Planning","Attachments":[],"Id":1880240,"PostDate":1418408087,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>travelgal78, on 11 December 2014 - 07:15 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi Gals!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are only 95 days from our wedding! I feel like this year is flying by...getting so excited!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Anyways, fianc\u00e9 and I are trying to figure out an alternative to the traditional unity candle or sand ceremony. We are considering writing letters to each other and placing them into a tequila bottle to be opened on our 5th anniversary (similar to the wine box ceremony but with a Mexico twist). We would then do a shot at the end to celebrate.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thoughts? Lame or cute? Would love to hear what other DW brides think! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>This is a cute Idea travelgal78,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Actually one of my past bride what they did at the ceremony instead of a sand cereomy was a margarita on the rocks. \u00a0we prepared everything that needed to go in the margarita and just before preparing it the both mothers handed them the tray to them just before the cereomony. it was so cute and different!!<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-h-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpa1\/v\/t35.0-12\/10856004_10204684495185205_1881777807_o.jpg?oh=764a8922eef3f5fb33a4e02c33d7c5cf&oe=548DED8D&__gda__=1418585440_cbd772ab534220b794a846e0fd2b5bf9\" alt=\"10856004_10204684495185205_1881777807_o.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html'>http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1326854387,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.238.215.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78472,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9456b94500bd47f0c013d879d87cd486","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"dreamweddings\"] I love the margarita idea!! Maybe I will look into that.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I definitely want to get awesome shot glasses or margarita glasses for it!&amp;nbsp; B)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;And yes, all of my guests are a party bunch. In fact, the tequila shot was my mother&#039;s idea&amp;nbsp; :lol:&amp;nbsp; :lol:&amp;nbsp; :lol:&amp;nbsp; We may make it \"cream tequila\" so it doesn&#039;t have as big of a burn afterwards.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks guys for the input!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880252,"PostDate":1418413601,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"250090\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/250090-dreamweddings\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">dreamweddings<\/span><\/a> I love the margarita idea!! Maybe I will look into that.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I definitely want to get awesome shot glasses or margarita glasses for it!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/cool.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt='B)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>And yes, all of my guests are a party bunch. In fact, the tequila shot was my mother's idea\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/laugh.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':lol:' \/>\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/laugh.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':lol:' \/>\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/laugh.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':lol:' \/>\u00a0 We may make it \"cream tequila\" so it doesn't have as big of a burn afterwards.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks guys for the input!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#00ffff;\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;\"><span style=\"font-family:'lucida sans unicode', 'lucida grande', sans-serif;\">*~Leslie~*<\/span><\/span><\/span> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/>","Email":"ltalbott78@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.88.142.22","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1366599591,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268835.jpg?_r=1391394238","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"travelgal78","Id":268835,"Name":"travelgal78","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.90.222.25","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78472,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"912e30777a220e87972eab8b968d4edb","RawContent":"[quote name=\"travelgal78\" post=\"1880252\" timestamp=\"1418413601\"]\n@[member=\"dreamweddings\"] I love the margarita idea!! Maybe I will look into that.\n\nI definitely want to get awesome shot glasses or margarita glasses for it!  B)\n\nAnd yes, all of my guests are a party bunch. In fact, the tequila shot was my mother&#039;s idea  :lol:  :lol:  :lol:  We may make it \"cream tequila\" so it doesn&#039;t have as big of a burn afterwards.\n\nThanks guys for the input![\/quote]I think the best part is that it was your mothers idea. Love it :)\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1880267,"PostDate":1418420263,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>travelgal78, on 12 December 2014 - 11:46 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"250090\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/250090-dreamweddings\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">dreamweddings<\/span><\/a> I love the margarita idea!! Maybe I will look into that.<br><br>\nI definitely want to get awesome shot glasses or margarita glasses for it!  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/cool.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt='B)' \/><br><br>\nAnd yes, all of my guests are a party bunch. In fact, the tequila shot was my mother's idea  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/laugh.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':lol:' \/>  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/laugh.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':lol:' \/>  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/laugh.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':lol:' \/>  We may make it \"cream tequila\" so it doesn't have as big of a burn afterwards.<br><br>\nThanks guys for the input!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nI think the best part is that it was your mothers idea. Love it <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399428602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"159.53.110.142","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78472,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"36911f4bed7b07a078a56dc205be9968","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I think it is a GREAT idea! My sister got married in Mexico and as the bridal party walked from the hotel room to the wedding location we stopped at the pool bar and all did a shot. Totally spontaneous so the photographer wasn&#039;t even there. Fortunately another guest took our picture, tracked my sister down for her email address, and sent it to her. It is one of the BEST pictures from the wedding.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Long story short, it&#039;ll be something different and memorable and it&#039;ll up the fun factor! I may steal the idea (but with rum instead, since we&#039;ll be in Jamaica)!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880278,"PostDate":1418425727,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I think it is a GREAT idea! My sister got married in Mexico and as the bridal party walked from the hotel room to the wedding location we stopped at the pool bar and all did a shot. Totally spontaneous so the photographer wasn't even there. Fortunately another guest took our picture, tracked my sister down for her email address, and sent it to her. It is one of the BEST pictures from the wedding.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Long story short, it'll be something different and memorable and it'll up the fun factor! I may steal the idea (but with rum instead, since we'll be in Jamaica)!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.shaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"159.53.174.144","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403116087,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beckys98","Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"78472","Title":"Tequila Shot Instead Of Sand Ceremony?","LastPostDate":1433117826},"Pages":{"TotalItems":32,"TotalPages":4,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":30},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
