{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":4,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":362,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1860617,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":277737,"Name":"2015Bride","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1405692979,"LastPoster":{"Id":277737,"Name":"2015Bride","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1860617,"PostDate":1405692979,"PostContent":"I am new to this site and any information\/advice is greatly appreciated! We will be getting marri...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"maryd0402@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"66.69.193.8","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1398610272,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"2015Bride","Id":277737,"Name":"2015Bride","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.42.152.12","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"df26d416a62c6341c7d4a62e9a309a2d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I am new to this site and any information\/advice is greatly appreciated! We will be getting married at the Sandos Playacar Resort on June 10, 2015.&amp;nbsp; We are beyond excited and cant wait for the day to come!! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1860617,"PostDate":1405692979,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am new to this site and any information\/advice is greatly appreciated! We will be getting married at the Sandos Playacar Resort on June 10, 2015.\u00a0 We are beyond excited and cant wait for the day to come!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"maryd0402@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"66.69.193.8","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1398610272,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"2015Bride","Id":277737,"Name":"2015Bride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.77.36.17","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3bd39680470b4939491b531d0563e81b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community, 2015Bride, and Congrats on your Sandos Playacar Resort wedding coming up next June!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You&#039;ll find tons of great info, advice, support and ideas here to help with your planning decisions - so you&#039;re already off to a great start, good job :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;For some added inspiration, here are some magical wedding \"moments that matter\" Linc captured at your chosen resort - the Sandos Playacar.......with more at the album link here: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10151972421759487.1073741867.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Sandos Playacar Wedding Album&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-e-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpa1\/t1.0-9\/945467_10151972426759487_938150580_n.jpg\" alt=\"945467_10151972426759487_938150580_n.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-f-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpa1\/t1.0-9\/969402_10151972427279487_1941566055_n.jpg\" alt=\"969402_10151972427279487_1941566055_n.jp\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you all the best with your plans - YEH!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1860695,"PostDate":1405702038,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community, 2015Bride, and Congrats on your Sandos Playacar Resort wedding coming up next June!!!<\/p>\n<p>You'll find tons of great info, advice, support and ideas here to help with your planning decisions - so you're already off to a great start, good job <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>For some added inspiration, here are some magical wedding \"moments that matter\" Linc captured at your chosen resort - the Sandos Playacar.......with more at the album link here: <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10151972421759487.1073741867.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Sandos Playacar Wedding Album<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-e-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpa1\/t1.0-9\/945467_10151972426759487_938150580_n.jpg\" alt=\"945467_10151972426759487_938150580_n.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-f-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpa1\/t1.0-9\/969402_10151972427279487_1941566055_n.jpg\" alt=\"969402_10151972427279487_1941566055_n.jp\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you all the best with your plans - YEH!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280210660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.204.139.101","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c7825be855718c212b7a303142a7c86f","RawContent":"Has anyone here got married at the Occidental Resort in Aruba? We are getting married May 2015 at 6pm. So excited! Any advice would be greatly appreciated. Wedding is at 6pm, will our pics be ruined by beach goers? \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1860942,"PostDate":1405788793,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Has anyone here got married at the Occidental Resort in Aruba? We are getting married May 2015 at 6pm. So excited! Any advice would be greatly appreciated. Wedding is at 6pm, will our pics be ruined by beach goers? <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"vanessa_dangelo@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"68.204.139.101","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1405788665,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279082.jpg?_r=1405788665","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"waitswedding2015","Id":279082,"Name":"waitswedding2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"107.77.66.51","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"41f31a04cd52270214577cf776efc9a2","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Moments That Matter\" post=\"1860695\" timestamp=\"1405702038\"]\nWelcome to our forum community, 2015Bride, and Congrats on your Sandos Playacar Resort wedding coming up next June!!!\nYou&#039;ll find tons of great info, advice, support and ideas here to help with your planning decisions - so you&#039;re already off to a great start, good job :)\n \nFor some added inspiration, here are some magical wedding \"moments that matter\" Linc captured at your chosen resort - the Sandos Playacar.......with more at the album link here: [url=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10151972421759487.1073741867.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3\"]Sandos Playacar Wedding Album[\/url]\n \n[img]https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-e-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpa1\/t1.0-9\/945467_10151972426759487_938150580_n.jpg[\/img]\n \n[img]https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-f-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpa1\/t1.0-9\/969402_10151972427279487_1941566055_n.jpg[\/img]\n \nWishing you all the best with your plans - YEH!!! team MTM :)[\/quote][quote name=\"2015Bride\" post=\"1862169\" timestamp=\"1406250769\"]\n[quote name=\"Moments That Matter\" post=\"1860695\" timestamp=\"1405702038\"]\nWelcome to our forum community, 2015Bride, and Congrats on your Sandos Playacar Resort wedding coming up next June!!!\nYou&#039;ll find tons of great info, advice, support and ideas here to help with your planning decisions - so you&#039;re already off to a great start, good job :)\n \n\nFor some added inspiration, here are some magical wedding \"moments that matter\" Linc captured at your chosen resort - the Sandos Playacar.......with more at the album link here: [url=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10151972421759487.1073741867.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3\"]Sandos Playacar Wedding Album[\/url]\n [img]https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-e-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpa1\/t1.0-9\/945467_10151972426759487_938150580_n.jpg[\/img]\n [img]https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-f-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpa1\/t1.0-9\/969402_10151972427279487_1941566055_n.jpg[\/img]\n \nWishing you all the best with your plans - YEH!!! team MTM :)[\/quote][\/quote]Great pics! Do you know if resort fees had to be paid for you guys to be the photographers?","Attachments":[],"Id":1862169,"PostDate":1406250857,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Moments That Matter, on 18 July 2014 - 08:47 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>\nWelcome to our forum community, 2015Bride, and Congrats on your Sandos Playacar Resort wedding coming up next June!!!<br>\nYou'll find tons of great info, advice, support and ideas here to help with your planning decisions - so you're already off to a great start, good job <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br>\n\u00a0<br>\nFor some added inspiration, here are some magical wedding \"moments that matter\" Linc captured at your chosen resort - the Sandos Playacar.......with more at the album link here: <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10151972421759487.1073741867.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Sandos Playacar Wedding Album<\/a><br>\n\u00a0<br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-e-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpa1\/t1.0-9\/945467_10151972426759487_938150580_n.jpg\" alt=\"945467_10151972426759487_938150580_n.jpg\"><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-f-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpa1\/t1.0-9\/969402_10151972427279487_1941566055_n.jpg\" alt=\"969402_10151972427279487_1941566055_n.jp\"><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br>\nWishing you all the best with your plans - YEH!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p><\/div><\/div><br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>2015Bride, on 24 July 2014 - 05:12 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p><\/p><blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"Moments That Matter\" data-cid=\"1860695\" data-time=\"1405702038\"><p>\nWelcome to our forum community, 2015Bride, and Congrats on your Sandos Playacar Resort wedding coming up next June!!!<br>\nYou'll find tons of great info, advice, support and ideas here to help with your planning decisions - so you're already off to a great start, good job <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br>\n\u00a0<br><br>\nFor some added inspiration, here are some magical wedding \"moments that matter\" Linc captured at your chosen resort - the Sandos Playacar.......with more at the album link here: <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10151972421759487.1073741867.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Sandos Playacar Wedding Album<\/a><br>\n\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-e-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpa1\/t1.0-9\/945467_10151972426759487_938150580_n.jpg\" alt=\"945467_10151972426759487_938150580_n.jpg\"><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-f-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpa1\/t1.0-9\/969402_10151972427279487_1941566055_n.jpg\" alt=\"969402_10151972427279487_1941566055_n.jp\"><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br>\nWishing you all the best with your plans - YEH!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p><\/div><\/div><\/blockquote>\n<br>\nGreat pics! Do you know if resort fees had to be paid for you guys to be the photographers? \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"maryd0402@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"66.69.193.8","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1398610272,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"2015Bride","Id":277737,"Name":"2015Bride","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"77561","Title":"New Sandos Playacar Bride June 2015","LastPostDate":1406250857},"Pages":{"TotalItems":4,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
