{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.153.117.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65267,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"545672aedf963ccec39bd85fbb2d3621","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;great ideas&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1839064,"PostDate":1395191582,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>great ideas<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"curltop475@aol.com","IpAddress":"68.39.65.38","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1376402005,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272533.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":89,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Traci Felton","Id":272533,"Name":"Traci Felton","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"205.132.110.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65267,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7bbb94e3a8d69f70c446f8691a19e2f6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thanks for sharing!!! &amp;nbsp;Anyone got beach towels for their guests??? We&#039;re not having too many guests and have been considering getting beach towels... Thoughts welcome ladies!!! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1841508,"PostDate":1396283027,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thanks for sharing!!! \u00a0Anyone got beach towels for their guests??? We're not having too many guests and have been considering getting beach towels... Thoughts welcome ladies!!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bambiderby@gmail.com","IpAddress":"205.132.110.2","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1395176260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277216.jpg?_r=1395766815","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":218,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"forevertogether","Id":277216,"Name":"forevertogether","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"188.29.166.76","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65267,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c74c0f09cdd22c8ce20f22f02c17ba6b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Brilliant idea will use that myself!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1872760,"PostDate":1411470036,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Brilliant idea will use that myself!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"justineatack@gmail.com","IpAddress":"31.54.1.116","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1410011856,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279711.jpg?_r=1410256327","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bride2b15","Id":279711,"Name":"Bride2b15","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.150.123.245","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65267,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f993ebf8f821322a7d18c4c6809176b1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Definitely providing OOT bags for our guests as well. &amp;nbsp;My big question though is... How do people bring all this stuff to the resort? &amp;nbsp;Or do you provide it to guests ahead of time?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My plan is to bring it in either a duffle bag that may have to get checked en route to Mexico, but something that can be folded up and brought back in my suitcase on our way home. &amp;nbsp;Is this how others have done it as well or am I making things too complicated for myself?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks in advance for your help!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1897781,"PostDate":1433290969,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Definitely providing OOT bags for our guests as well. \u00a0My big question though is... How do people bring all this stuff to the resort? \u00a0Or do you provide it to guests ahead of time?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My plan is to bring it in either a duffle bag that may have to get checked en route to Mexico, but something that can be folded up and brought back in my suitcase on our way home. \u00a0Is this how others have done it as well or am I making things too complicated for myself?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks in advance for your help!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"roya03@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.150.85.250","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1422717651,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"sawyer2014","Id":281963,"Name":"sawyer2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.151.222.103","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65267,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"823d3d2218f9dc607bd0996a54fade85","RawContent":"I used suitcases and just stacked the ones I didn&#039;t need on the way home inside themselves.  Truth be told though I had only one extra to stack on the way home because our dirty clothes took up so much room lol\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1897783,"PostDate":1433293467,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I used suitcases and just stacked the ones I didn't need on the way home inside themselves.  Truth be told though I had only one extra to stack on the way home because our dirty clothes took up so much room lol<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399428602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.192.32.8","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65267,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ffcdff7e9cc2333f4110716a00b6937b","RawContent":"[quote name=\"jd0922\" post=\"1838324\" timestamp=\"1394904368\"]\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/pin\/534661786984521352\/\"]http:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/pin\/534661786984521352\/[\/url]\n \nLove this idea -- key\/tip holder with spanish essentials on the back! I can see my guests actually trying these out during the day if they are right there on their key holder\/\n[\/quote]Hello! Where did you find these? Love them so cute! Also, can anyone tell me where you got all the travel essentials for your oot bags like the little Advil and medicines?? Is there a good website?? Thanks!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1898060,"PostDate":1433762464,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>jd0922, on 15 March 2014 - 09:26 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p><a href='http:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/pin\/534661786984521352\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.pinterest...61786984521352\/<\/a><br>\n\u00a0<br>\nLove this idea -- key\/tip holder with spanish essentials on the back! I can see my guests actually trying these out during the day if they are right there on their key holder\/<br><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nHello! Where did you find these? Love them so cute! Also, can anyone tell me where you got all the travel essentials for your oot bags like the little Advil and medicines?? Is there a good website?? Thanks!! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lornj29@aim.com","IpAddress":"68.192.37.147","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1410109020,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"lornj29","Id":279723,"Name":"lornj29","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"205.244.233.143","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65267,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c4451199ba5bf13c661a86f25a7c664c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m with ya @[member=\"lornj29\"] I&#039;m looking for a site too! Wanted to start early!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898213,"PostDate":1433866155,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm with ya @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279723\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279723-lornj29\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">lornj29<\/span><\/a> I'm looking for a site too! Wanted to start early!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"victoria_salv@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"205.244.233.143","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423174962,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282014.jpg?_r=1428610987","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"victoriasalv","Id":282014,"Name":"victoriasalv","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"201.116.201.71","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65267,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"67ab592b127b639445065c4cbacd9c62","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#1cdeb9;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;Hi @[member=\"ANGELA2013\"] &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\"&gt;We have a few suggestions for wedding favors:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#1cdeb9;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;Choose something related to the place you\u2019re getting married at&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;Have something from the place you\u2019re getting married. One of the things that make the event unique is the location (that\u2019s why you traveled all the way there). So you can honor that by getting something from a local shop. For instance, you could give your guest little tequila bottles, hand painted maracas or some traditional candy.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#1cdeb9;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;Buy once you arrive to your destination, if possible&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;You could get some benefits by doing this: you won\u2019t have to worry about packaging and carrying too much luggage, suitcases being lost or forgetting to bring all the stuff.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#1cdeb9;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;Favors your guests can use&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;For instance, for a beach wedding a great idea will be to give out colorful flip-flops for the ceremony or something as helpful as a decorated hand fan (your guest will deeply appreciate it). Other great items you can give out for favor are small bags with useful items such as sun block, wipes, lip balm, &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;koozie&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;\u2019s or expandable towels,or even something fun like a set of playing cards.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#1cdeb9;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;Something you can eat&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;If you give out something edible it\u2019s more likely that people will appreciate it and you could be reminded for the traditional candies, fritters or delicious snack for late night cravers.&amp;nbsp; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hope this helps! Here&#039;s a picture:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81350]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com\/&#039;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#548dd4;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:garamond, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#548dd4;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:garamond, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Email: info@adventureweddingsvallarta.com&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#548dd4;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:garamond, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Toll Free: 1 866.731.8152&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898465,"PostDate":1434129261,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><strong><span  style=\"color:#1cdeb9\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"249828\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/249828-angela2013\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">ANGELA2013<\/span><\/a> <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif\">We have a few suggestions for wedding favors:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul><li><strong><span  style=\"color:#1cdeb9\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">Choose something related to the place you\u2019re getting married at<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul><p><span  style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"color:#282828\">Have something from the place you\u2019re getting married. One of the things that make the event unique is the location (that\u2019s why you traveled all the way there). So you can honor that by getting something from a local shop. For instance, you could give your guest little tequila bottles, hand painted maracas or some traditional candy.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<ul><li><span  style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><span  style=\"color:#1cdeb9\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">Buy once you arrive to your destination, if possible<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul><p><span  style=\"color:#282828\">You could get some benefits by doing this: you won\u2019t have to worry about packaging and carrying too much luggage, suitcases being lost or forgetting to bring all the stuff.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<ul><li><strong><span  style=\"color:#1cdeb9\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">Favors your guests can use<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul><p><span  style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"color:#282828\">For instance, for a beach wedding a great idea will be to give out colorful flip-flops for the ceremony or something as helpful as a decorated hand fan (your guest will deeply appreciate it). Other great items you can give out for favor are small bags with useful items such as sun block, wipes, lip balm, <\/span><span  style=\"color:#282828\">koozie<\/span><span  style=\"color:#282828\">\u2019s or expandable towels,or even something fun like a set of playing cards.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<ul><li><strong><span  style=\"color:#1cdeb9\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">Something you can eat<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul><p><span  style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"color:#282828\">If you give out something edible it\u2019s more likely that people will appreciate it and you could be reminded for the traditional candies, fritters or delicious snack for late night cravers.\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope this helps! Here's a picture:<\/p>\n<p><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/81350-favorscaletas\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_10944\/sml_gallery_258213_10944_67802.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='FavorsCaletas'  width='200' height='200'  alt='FavorsCaletas' id='sml_image_view_81350' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><strong><span  style=\"color:#548dd4\"><span  style=\"font-family:garamond, serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p><strong><span  style=\"color:#548dd4\"><span  style=\"font-family:garamond, serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Email: info@adventureweddingsvallarta.com<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><span  style=\"color:#548dd4\"><span  style=\"font-family:garamond, serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Toll Free: 1 866.731.8152<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dennise@adventureweddingsvallarta.com","IpAddress":"187.146.166.254","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1343058803,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258213.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LasCaletas","Id":258213,"Name":"LasCaletas","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.15.187","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65267,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a3703ae39fc3d95c151c74bc46522c51","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"victoriasalv\"] and @lornj29&amp;nbsp; there are a couple of sites that have been mentioned here I think. Also depends whether you&#039;re in the US or canada. These are the two that I noted but haven&#039;t yet ordered anything from them. You could search in the search bar up top and see if any reviews pop up. I know I&#039;ve read info but just don&#039;t remember when or who by. Sorry that&#039;s not much help.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.alltravelsizes.com\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.alltravelsizes.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.minimus.biz\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.minimus.biz\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898571,"PostDate":1434340262,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282014\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282014-victoriasalv\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">victoriasalv<\/span><\/a> and @lornj29\u00a0 there are a couple of sites that have been mentioned here I think. Also depends whether you're in the US or canada. These are the two that I noted but haven't yet ordered anything from them. You could search in the search bar up top and see if any reviews pop up. I know I've read info but just don't remember when or who by. Sorry that's not much help.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.alltravelsizes.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.alltravelsizes.com\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.minimus.biz\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.minimus.biz\/<\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283458999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":19,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
