> User lizzard84 (283633)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"23.17.81.153","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78500,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3b4d3fa58bdcf476902f4c3be2ed6a79","RawContent":"[quote name=\"jackielemman\" post=\"1880929\" timestamp=\"1419277069\"]\nI didn&#039;t do OOT bags. I decided to use my money to provide memorable experiences for the guests while they were in Cancun! It was the smartest decision I made!! First... you dont have to lug all of the bags and their goodies all the way to your destination and spend your precious time putting them together. Second, people are coming to your wedding to do things with you and would rather have a cool experience than some advil, pepto, and some chapstick! Most of the OOT items people bring for themselves when going on vacation-- and the rest of the items never get used. \n \nI did a private Tequila tasting at our rehearsal dinner and chartered a catamaran for all our guests. Even if you choose to do a group dance lesson or an excursion or hire marriachi-- anything will be extra special and will provide lasting memories for you and your guests!\n \nHope this helps![\/quote]Oh that sounds like a lot of fun. I&#039;ll need to look into a catamaran and the dance lessons. Would you mind sharing who you used for the catamaran?\n[quote name=\"Mrsktobe\" post=\"1880936\" timestamp=\"1419277994\"]\nWe did bubba&#039;s and I am SO happy we did - I debating filling our OOT bags to the brim and then thought the bubba&#039;s were more of a worthwhile investments for our guests as the husband I travel quite a bit and it&#039;s one of those things you don&#039;t realize how useful they are until you have one. :) Ordering them online was waaaaay cheaper off of the bubba kegs website and I got them sent to our PO box in the states.\n \nHowever I ended up gettings bags off of bagiva. They were linen bags that were like a $1 each, so I ended up paying 30 bucks with taxes, shipping and what not. In our bags, we ended up putting the bubba, welcome book, and toys for the kids but that was about it. The feedback with just the bags and bubba&#039;s alone made me think they were so worthwhile.\n[\/quote]That&#039;s a great deal on the bags! Everywhere I&#039;ve been looking cost a lot more then that. Where did you get your welcome book?","Attachments":[],"Id":1880958,"PostDate":1419284554,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>jackielemman, on 22 December 2014 - 11:37 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I didn't do OOT bags. I decided to use my money to provide memorable experiences for the guests while they were in Cancun! It was the smartest decision I made!! First... you dont have to lug all of the bags and their goodies all the way to your destination and spend your precious time putting them together. Second, people are coming to your wedding to do things with you and would rather have a cool experience than some advil, pepto, and some chapstick! Most of the OOT items people bring for themselves when going on vacation-- and the rest of the items never get used.\u00a0<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nI did a private Tequila tasting at our rehearsal dinner and chartered a catamaran for all our guests. Even if you choose to do a group dance lesson or an excursion or hire marriachi-- anything will be extra special and will provide lasting memories for you and your guests!<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nHope this helps!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nOh that sounds like a lot of fun. I'll need to look into a catamaran and the dance lessons. Would you mind sharing who you used for the catamaran?<br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Mrsktobe, on 22 December 2014 - 11:53 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>\nWe did bubba's and I am SO happy we did - I debating filling our OOT bags to the brim and then thought the bubba's were more of a worthwhile investments for our guests as the husband I travel quite a bit and it's one of those things you don't realize how useful they are until you have one. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Ordering them online was waaaaay cheaper off of the bubba kegs website and I got them sent to our PO box in the states.<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nHowever I ended up gettings bags off of bagiva. They were linen bags that were like a $1 each, so I ended up paying\u00a030 bucks with taxes, shipping\u00a0and what not. In our bags, we ended up putting the bubba, welcome book, and toys for the kids but that was about it. The feedback with just the bags and bubba's alone made me think they were so worthwhile.<br><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nThat's a great deal on the bags! Everywhere I've been looking cost a lot more then that. Where did you get your welcome book?  \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kcrosby86@msn.com","IpAddress":"142.179.243.111","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1398829631,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Kayla88","Id":277780,"Name":"Kayla88","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.108.35.133","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78500,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2c6d51193587880a7f4dad6cfb33c4fa","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Kayla88\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We used Samba Catamarans. Very good communication and was able to pay via paypal! :) Had the best time ever on the cruise. They took us snorkeling then were able to parasail off the back of the boat. Once in a lifetime experience for most of my guests. They worked with our budget too which was really appreciated.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880960,"PostDate":1419284908,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277780\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277780-kayla88\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Kayla88<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We used Samba Catamarans. Very good communication and was able to pay via paypal! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Had the best time ever on the cruise. They took us snorkeling then were able to parasail off the back of the boat. Once in a lifetime experience for most of my guests. They worked with our budget too which was really appreciated.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jackielemman86@comcast.net","IpAddress":"70.123.142.233","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1379799598,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273651.jpg?_r=1388803183","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":268,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jackielemman","Id":273651,"Name":"jackielemman","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.69.212.114","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78500,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8349b195cd3c207db8289de76563a73b","RawContent":"Here are the tote bags I ordered:\n&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bagiva.com\/100-Cotton-Economical-Tote-Bag.html&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bagiva.com\/100-Cotton-Economical-Tote-Bag.html&lt;\/a&gt;\n\nEnded up buying some iron on paper at Michaels using their weekly 40% off coupon and creating a logo with designmatic:\n&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.designmantic.com\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.designmantic.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;\n\nWelcome books I created and did all on my own with a rough template I had found on here.. I just spruced it up a lot more and added a lot more information. Printed the covers on cardstock I got at Michaels and got the rest printed at Staples front and back in a large quantity - it came out to 50.00 but well worth saving the time I would of used printing it on my crappy printer\nI still have it incase you want me to send it to you!","Attachments":[],"Id":1880961,"PostDate":1419285051,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Here are the tote bags I ordered:<br><a href='http:\/\/www.bagiva.com\/100-Cotton-Economical-Tote-Bag.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.bagiva.co...l-Tote-Bag.html<\/a><br><br>Ended up buying some iron on paper at Michaels using their weekly 40% off coupon and creating a logo with designmatic:<br><a href='http:\/\/www.designmantic.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.designmantic.com\/<\/a><br><br>Welcome books I created and did all on my own with a rough template I had found on here.. I just spruced it up a lot more and added a lot more information. Printed the covers on cardstock I got at Michaels and got the rest printed at Staples front and back in a large quantity - it came out to 50.00 but well worth saving the time I would of used printing it on my crappy printer<br>I still have it incase you want me to send it to you!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lcboyko@ualberta.ca","IpAddress":"23.17.180.191","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1304972291,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239790.jpg?_r=1434572414","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mrsktobe","Id":239790,"Name":"Mrsktobe","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"23.17.81.153","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78500,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e4208b0ee3c5e9e34f0d746bd1bc55e7","RawContent":"Awesome thank you so much ladies! \n\n@[member=\"jackielemman\"] I will defiantly look into them and hopefully they fix into my budget as well.  It would be an amazing experience for everyone :)\n\n\n@[member=\"Mrsktobe\"] I would love if you could send me your template :) I will PM you my email :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1880968,"PostDate":1419287117,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Awesome thank you so much ladies! <br>\n@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"273651\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/273651-jackielemman\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jackielemman<\/span><\/a> I will defiantly look into them and hopefully they fix into my budget as well.  It would be an amazing experience for everyone <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br>\n@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"239790\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/239790-mrsktobe\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Mrsktobe<\/span><\/a> I would love if you could send me your template <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I will PM you my email <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kcrosby86@msn.com","IpAddress":"142.179.243.111","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1398829631,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Kayla88","Id":277780,"Name":"Kayla88","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.233.200.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78500,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"06093f6e35bf1b52d52cc2e21bcf15dc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I agree that most people will not know about the welcome bags but either way it will be appreciated. &amp;nbsp;I plan to do just a few small things and possibly pay for a group catamaran snorkeling activity as the wedding favor\/gift.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;I have only been to 1 dw before and was pleasantly surprised with the oot bags, although we never used most of the items while on the trip.. but I really enjoyed the personal letter they wrote to all the guests thanking everyone it was very heartfelt and that means a lot!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"jackielemman\"] where did the catamaran take you for snorkelling?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1881001,"PostDate":1419316237,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I agree that most people will not know about the welcome bags but either way it will be appreciated. \u00a0I plan to do just a few small things and possibly pay for a group catamaran snorkeling activity as the wedding favor\/gift.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0I have only been to 1 dw before and was pleasantly surprised with the oot bags, although we never used most of the items while on the trip.. but I really enjoyed the personal letter they wrote to all the guests thanking everyone it was very heartfelt and that means a lot!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"273651\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/273651-jackielemman\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jackielemman<\/span><\/a> where did the catamaran take you for snorkelling?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#cc6666;\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;\"><em>Forever can never be long enough for me, to feel like I've had long enough with you...19\/01\/2016<\/em><\/span><\/span>","Email":"kimberlydiana@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.76.172.36","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1412304687,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280238.png?_r=1412619945","PhotoWidth":80,"PhotoHeight":60,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kimmyd2","Id":280238,"Name":"kimmyd2","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.57.1","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78500,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e66c7eac534afaa597278b148f0713f2","RawContent":"I agree that most ppl will not expect anything. My guests were very appreciative, but I think the hangover kits got the most use - along with city maps. I considered cups but decided against - at the resort I stayed at, I saw zero ppl with their own cups - In two weeks. Maybe it was just the resort? \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1881004,"PostDate":1419318091,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I agree that most ppl will not expect anything. My guests were very appreciative, but I think the hangover kits got the most use - along with city maps. I considered cups but decided against - at the resort I stayed at, I saw zero ppl with their own cups - In two weeks. Maybe it was just the resort? <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"chelseapjohnson@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"70.72.57.238","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1361494468,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266402.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"chelseapaige37","Id":266402,"Name":"chelseapaige37","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.53.250.35","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78500,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ebf3a3539483853582aa13d1ef9c7f41","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;@&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_member\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/239790-mrsktobe\/\" title=\"\"&gt;Mrsktobe&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;what kind of Bubbas did you get for your guests? I don&#039;t know much about them, but I think I need to get one!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1881009,"PostDate":1419343422,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">@<\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/239790-mrsktobe\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>Mrsktobe<\/a>\u00a0what kind of Bubbas did you get for your guests? I don't know much about them, but I think I need to get one!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rachelia160@aim.com","IpAddress":"66.61.104.237","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1388731897,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275855.jpg?_r=1431444128","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"rachelia160","Id":275855,"Name":"rachelia160","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.106.6.122","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78500,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"694b9c45a0861c711281717b698a4967","RawContent":"Great info, thanks ladies! I was also wondering about doing the oot bags, yet concerned that they wouldn&#039;t be used and also about the cost. I think I may just do a tumbler with a personal note and luggage tag. I&#039;m also thinking of just bringing extra Advil, pepto and stuff like this  just in case  if anyone needs it I have it.","Attachments":[],"Id":1881013,"PostDate":1419343737,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Great info, thanks ladies! I was also wondering about doing the oot bags, yet concerned that they wouldn't be used and also about the cost. I think I may just do a tumbler with a personal note and luggage tag. I'm also thinking of just bringing extra Advil, pepto and stuff like this  just in case  if anyone needs it I have it.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarajenkins@bellsouth.net","IpAddress":"174.106.6.122","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1408622600,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Surfingsara","Id":279511,"Name":"Surfingsara","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78500,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"80d91d64aad2c030a1c9343e7849faf5","RawContent":"[quote name=\"rachelia160\" post=\"1881009\" timestamp=\"1419343422\"]\n[color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]@[\/font][\/color][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/239790-mrsktobe\/\"]Mrsktobe[\/url] what kind of Bubbas did you get for your guests? I don&#039;t know much about them, but I think I need to get one![\/quote]\nDepending on the amount of guests you have, that may limit the size you can purchase if you plan to bring them all down to Mexico as a surprise.  I have the 34oz one for myself personally and it&#039;s huge - if I had to bring 44 OMG they would need so many suitcases.   I have a feeling she used the 20oz ones (they are the $6.99 ones on the Bubba website).   I paid $16.99 for mine but didn&#039;t get it thru the Bubba website.    [url=\"http:\/\/www.shopbubba.com\/shop-all\/mugs\/bubba-20-oz-mug-classic-pink\/\"]http:\/\/www.shopbubba.com\/shop-all\/mugs\/bubba-20-oz-mug-classic-pink\/[\/url]\nIf you sign up you can get a 15% off code too.","Attachments":[],"Id":1881021,"PostDate":1419345209,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>rachelia160, on 23 December 2014 - 06:03 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">@<\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/239790-mrsktobe\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>Mrsktobe<\/a>\u00a0what kind of Bubbas did you get for your guests? I don't know much about them, but I think I need to get one!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Depending on the amount of guests you have, that may limit the size you can purchase if you plan to bring them all down to Mexico as a surprise. \u00a0I have the 34oz one for myself personally and it's huge - if I had to bring 44 OMG they would need so many suitcases. \u00a0 I have a feeling she used the 20oz ones (they are the $6.99 ones on the Bubba website). \u00a0 I paid $16.99 for mine but didn't get it thru the Bubba website. \u00a0 \u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.shopbubba.com\/shop-all\/mugs\/bubba-20-oz-mug-classic-pink\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.shopbubba...g-classic-pink\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>If you sign up you can get a 15% off code too.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399428602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.69.212.114","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78500,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"71f634d0b054f3d1f16ab71105247136","RawContent":"[quote name=\"calgarybride2015\" post=\"1881021\" timestamp=\"1419345209\"]\nDepending on the amount of guests you have, that may limit the size you can purchase if you plan to bring them all down to Mexico as a surprise.  I have the 34oz one for myself personally and it&#039;s huge - if I had to bring 44 OMG they would need so many suitcases.   I have a feeling she used the 20oz ones (they are the $6.99 ones on the Bubba website).   I paid $16.99 for mine but didn&#039;t get it thru the Bubba website.    [url=\"http:\/\/www.shopbubba.com\/shop-all\/mugs\/bubba-20-oz-mug-classic-pink\/\"]http:\/\/www.shopbubba.com\/shop-all\/mugs\/bubba-20-oz-mug-classic-pink\/[\/url]\nIf you sign up you can get a 15% off code too.[\/quote]She&#039;s right, I got the 20 oz ones. and LOL I ended up bringing 44 down hahaha. I was that person. We got Option plus, plus spread them out between a few of our friends. I also bubble wrapped all of them with bubble wrap from home depot. Because I got so many of them, there was a discount - I think it was 15-20% off bulk orders. I liked ordering off the website as there were various colors to choose from. And the customer service was awesome. We ended up receiving 3 broken ones and they shipped out new ones, no problem the next day.","Attachments":[],"Id":1881028,"PostDate":1419350020,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-time=\"1419345209\" data-cid=\"1881021\" data-author=\"calgarybride2015\"><p>Depending on the amount of guests you have, that may limit the size you can purchase if you plan to bring them all down to Mexico as a surprise. \u00a0I have the 34oz one for myself personally and it's huge - if I had to bring 44 OMG they would need so many suitcases. \u00a0 I have a feeling she used the 20oz ones (they are the $6.99 ones on the Bubba website). \u00a0 I paid $16.99 for mine but didn't get it thru the Bubba website. \u00a0 \u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.shopbubba.com\/shop-all\/mugs\/bubba-20-oz-mug-classic-pink\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.shopbubba...g-classic-pink\/<\/a><br>If you sign up you can get a 15% off code too.<\/p><\/blockquote><br>She's right, I got the 20 oz ones. and LOL I ended up bringing 44 down hahaha. I was that person. We got Option plus, plus spread them out between a few of our friends. I also bubble wrapped all of them with bubble wrap from home depot. Because I got so many of them, there was a discount - I think it was 15-20% off bulk orders. I liked ordering off the website as there were various colors to choose from. And the customer service was awesome. We ended up receiving 3 broken ones and they shipped out new ones, no problem the next day.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lcboyko@ualberta.ca","IpAddress":"23.17.180.191","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1304972291,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239790.jpg?_r=1434572414","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mrsktobe","Id":239790,"Name":"Mrsktobe","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":43,"TotalPages":5,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":40},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
