Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":163,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":82780,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1547798,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":237176,"Name":"MJKH","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237176.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1321557888,"LastPoster":{"Id":283438,"Name":"apberg2002","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":44,"Preview":{"Id":1547798,"PostDate":1321557888,"PostContent":"So, after almost 10 months of scouring BDW threads for ideas, couponing, collecting free samples...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"janelleh@sasktel.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1298649121,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237176.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MJKH","Id":237176,"Name":"MJKH","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64500,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":4,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d31edce8dcf1244ccaa4cbec54d96faf","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; So, after almost 10 months of scouring BDW threads for ideas, couponing, collecting free samples and watching for bargains wherever I went, it was finally time to put our wedding week survival kits together! &amp;nbsp;Many of you already know that I have been agonizing over whether or not to take all of this stuff with us to compile the kits (and have them delivered as a surprise to each room) or to give them out before hand. &amp;nbsp;After studying the pile of goodies in my basement...and getting real with myself about how much OTHER stuff we have to take with us, we have decided to hand them out ahead of time to the majority of our guests. &amp;nbsp;We will be hosting a Christmas open house...that will give all the locals (friends and family) a chance to get to know each other a little better, and our guests an opportunity to ask questions about the resort, excursions, etc. &amp;nbsp;The compromise is that we will be taking along some edible treats...and a few other goodies (travel candle, photo album) that will be given\/delivered to each guest the night of their arrival.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Here goes...&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Each of the ladies will be given a toiletry bag filled with goodies. &amp;nbsp;The polka dot bags on the left side of the couch and the straw bags in the middle were purchased on clearance from Superstore at the end of the summer for between $3 and $4.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"IMG_0008.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/592009\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Taking things out of packages and putting everything out to see...reminded me of playing \"store\" as a kid!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"IMG_0013.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/592011\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"IMG_0014.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/592013\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"IMG_0015.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/592015\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I put a piece of tissue paper at the bottom of each toiletry bag to give it a \"full\" look.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"IMG_0017.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/592017\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Just to give you an idea of what went into each bag for the ladies...shaving cream, razors, dry shampoo, kleenex, lip balm, sewing kit (Michael&#039;s), ecotools bamboo nail files and heal scrubber (http:\/\/www.minimus.biz), ms manicure kit (http:\/\/www.minimus.biz), nail polish remover wipes (http:\/\/www.minimus.biz), hand sanitizer (Bath and Body Works).&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"IMG_0021.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/592020\/width\/525\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We ordered the oversize postcards from Vistaprint for the tops of the bags and they worked perfectly! &amp;nbsp;I bought a boning knife from Michael&#039;s, measured for the mid-line of the card on the inside, put two tiny marks on each end and lined them up with a ruler. &amp;nbsp;When you run the boning knife alongside the ruler a couple of times, you get a crease which allows for a clean, smooth fold at the top of the card. &amp;nbsp;Then I clipped the edges for rounded corners...&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"IMG_0019.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/592026\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; A last-minute addition to our group means I had to improvise (as I was out of toiletry bags and not wanting to purchase anything more). &amp;nbsp;This guest will be getting her toiletries in a pink sinamay bag I had on hand.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"IMG_0014-2.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/592023\/width\/525\/height\/700\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; max-width: 100%; cursor: default; \" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Guests will also get a customized note pad and sticky note...all done (along with the stickers) by Vistaprint.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"IMG_0024.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/592028\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; This is one of the bags for the flower girls which includes a customized notebook from Vistaprint, a bunch of toys and books and a beach towel.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"IMG_0017-2.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/592030\/width\/525\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; The final product coming together...we gave our mothers extras in their kits and will inform our guests that, should they require more of anything the week of the wedding, they should check in with them! &amp;nbsp;We will also have a large kit that we will take along with us on excursions (containing sunscreen, bug spray, a first aid kit and over-the-counter meds).&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"IMG_0029.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/592034\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Burlap bags and tissue paper came from Dollarama. &amp;nbsp;Tags were business cards with the corners clipped from Vistaprint and tied on with natural jute twine. &amp;nbsp;DONE!!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"IMG_0022.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/592036\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; What are we doing now? &amp;nbsp;Our goal is to get the pre-departure information booklets (passport style) done in the next week, printed and inserted in these passport covers from Michael&#039;s. &amp;nbsp;They will be given out along with the bags at the open house. &amp;nbsp;That way guests can actually take them to Mexico with their passports tucked safely inside. &amp;nbsp;Stay tuned...&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"IMG_0001.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/592042\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1547798,"PostDate":1321557888,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> So, after almost 10 months of scouring BDW threads for ideas, couponing, collecting free samples and watching for bargains wherever I went, it was finally time to put our wedding week survival kits together! \u00a0Many of you already know that I have been agonizing over whether or not to take all of this stuff with us to compile the kits (and have them delivered as a surprise to each room) or to give them out before hand. \u00a0After studying the pile of goodies in my basement...and getting real with myself about how much OTHER stuff we have to take with us, we have decided to hand them out ahead of time to the majority of our guests. \u00a0We will be hosting a Christmas open house...that will give all the locals (friends and family) a chance to get to know each other a little better, and our guests an opportunity to ask questions about the resort, excursions, etc. \u00a0The compromise is that we will be taking along some edible treats...and a few other goodies (travel candle, photo album) that will be given\/delivered to each guest the night of their arrival.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Here goes...<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Each of the ladies will be given a toiletry bag filled with goodies. \u00a0The polka dot bags on the left side of the couch and the straw bags in the middle were purchased on clearance from Superstore at the end of the summer for between $3 and $4.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"IMG_0008.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/592009\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Taking things out of packages and putting everything out to see...reminded me of playing \"store\" as a kid!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"IMG_0013.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/592011\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"IMG_0014.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/592013\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"IMG_0015.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/592015\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I put a piece of tissue paper at the bottom of each toiletry bag to give it a \"full\" look.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"IMG_0017.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/592017\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Just to give you an idea of what went into each bag for the ladies...shaving cream, razors, dry shampoo, kleenex, lip balm, sewing kit (Michael's), ecotools bamboo nail files and heal scrubber (<a href='http:\/\/www.minimus.biz' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.minimus.biz<\/a>), ms manicure kit (<a href='http:\/\/www.minimus.biz' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.minimus.biz<\/a>), nail polish remover wipes (<a href='http:\/\/www.minimus.biz' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.minimus.biz<\/a>), hand sanitizer (Bath and Body Works).<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"IMG_0021.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/592020\/width\/525\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We ordered the oversize postcards from Vistaprint for the tops of the bags and they worked perfectly! \u00a0I bought a boning knife from Michael's, measured for the mid-line of the card on the inside, put two tiny marks on each end and lined them up with a ruler. \u00a0When you run the boning knife alongside the ruler a couple of times, you get a crease which allows for a clean, smooth fold at the top of the card. \u00a0Then I clipped the edges for rounded corners...<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"IMG_0019.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/592026\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> A last-minute addition to our group means I had to improvise (as I was out of toiletry bags and not wanting to purchase anything more). \u00a0This guest will be getting her toiletries in a pink sinamay bag I had on hand.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"IMG_0014-2.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/592023\/width\/525\/height\/700\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; max-width: 100%; cursor: default; \" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Guests will also get a customized note pad and sticky note...all done (along with the stickers) by Vistaprint.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"IMG_0024.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/592028\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> This is one of the bags for the flower girls which includes a customized notebook from Vistaprint, a bunch of toys and books and a beach towel.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"IMG_0017-2.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/592030\/width\/525\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> The final product coming together...we gave our mothers extras in their kits and will inform our guests that, should they require more of anything the week of the wedding, they should check in with them! \u00a0We will also have a large kit that we will take along with us on excursions (containing sunscreen, bug spray, a first aid kit and over-the-counter meds).<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"IMG_0029.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/592034\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Burlap bags and tissue paper came from Dollarama. \u00a0Tags were business cards with the corners clipped from Vistaprint and tied on with natural jute twine. \u00a0DONE!!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"IMG_0022.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/592036\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> What are we doing now? \u00a0Our goal is to get the pre-departure information booklets (passport style) done in the next week, printed and inserted in these passport covers from Michael's. \u00a0They will be given out along with the bags at the open house. \u00a0That way guests can actually take them to Mexico with their passports tucked safely inside. \u00a0Stay tuned...<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"IMG_0001.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/592042\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"janelleh@sasktel.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1298649121,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237176.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MJKH","Id":237176,"Name":"MJKH","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64500,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"02a9eb27815952267a80c1ced412d7ba","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;Wow....MJKH - your bags are just absolutely perfect. &amp;nbsp;If I had more time to do it all over again - I would really relish in it all. &amp;nbsp;Your guest will be wowed by everything you took the time to do!!! Great Job&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1547801,"PostDate":1321558252,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n 