Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":1231,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":188573,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":570689,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":209491,"Name":"KLC77","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209491.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1232792470,"LastPoster":{"Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":44,"Preview":{"Id":570689,"PostDate":1232792470,"PostContent":"So, I thought it might be helpful for people who are putting together their OOT bags to know some...","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><strong>~Kelly<\/strong><br><br><strong>Our Awesome Wedding Pics:<\/strong><span> <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.delsolphotography.com\/weddings\/kelly&ron\/\">http:\/\/www.delsolphotography.com\/weddings\/kelly&ron\/<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kcoby@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1211276395,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209491.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KLC77","Id":209491,"Name":"KLC77","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":7,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"41dd1288a17ba9a06e12050506859d54","RawContent":"So, I thought it might be helpful for people who are putting together their OOT bags to know some of the things that people liked in mine and what they didn&#039;t really use.\n \n \n My bags had a lot of different stuff in them. The things that people used most and were really excited for were:\n \n The Find a Word Puzzles\/ Sodoku books~ A Big Hit!\n Decks of cards (a last minute addition that I&#039;m glad I put in)~ it was cloudy for several days and these came in handy\n First Aid Kits~ the bandaids were good for people who got blisters\n and the Pepto bismol tablets and Motrin\n \n The things that weren&#039;t used that I could&#039;ve done without were:\n \n The sunscreen with spf 30~ everyone knew they were heading somewhere sunny and packed their own\n Mini beach balls~ I didn&#039;t see one of these used except by my FI who kept beaning me in the head and finding it hilarious! lol\n Spanish for Dummies books~ as cute as they were no one read them\n OFF wipes~ I never saw a bug and no one mentioned anything about them\n \n I also would&#039;ve added twice as many Motrins to the bags. I put in the 99 cent packs that had a total of 6 tablets in them. People used them and probably could&#039;ve used more.","Attachments":[],"Id":570689,"PostDate":1232792470,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                So, I thought it might be helpful for people who are putting together their OOT bags to know some of the things that people liked in mine and what they didn't really use.<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> My bags had a lot of different stuff in them. The things that people used most and were really excited for were:<br \/> <br \/> The Find a Word Puzzles\/ Sodoku books~ A Big Hit!<br \/> Decks of cards (a last minute addition that I'm glad I put in)~ it was cloudy for several days and these came in handy<br \/> First Aid Kits~ the bandaids were good for people who got blisters<br \/> and the Pepto bismol tablets and Motrin<br \/> <br \/> The things that weren't used that I could've done without were:<br \/> <br \/> The sunscreen with spf 30~ everyone knew they were heading somewhere sunny and packed their own<br \/> Mini beach balls~ I didn't see one of these used except by my FI who kept beaning me in the head and finding it hilarious! lol<br \/> Spanish for Dummies books~ as cute as they were no one read them<br \/> OFF wipes~ I never saw a bug and no one mentioned anything about them<br \/> <br \/> I also would've added twice as many Motrins to the bags. I put in the 99 cent packs that had a total of 6 tablets in them. People used them and probably could've used more.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><strong>~Kelly<\/strong><br><br><strong>Our Awesome Wedding Pics:<\/strong><span> <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.delsolphotography.com\/weddings\/kelly&ron\/\">http:\/\/www.delsolphotography.com\/weddings\/kelly&ron\/<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kcoby@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1211276395,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209491.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KLC77","Id":209491,"Name":"KLC77","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6cfe74589c542040d507a27687366dc3","RawContent":"Good Thread, thanks for the info. I hope everyone will begin to list their shoulds and shouldn&#039;ts","Attachments":[],"Id":570695,"PostDate":1232794727,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Good Thread, thanks for the info. I hope everyone will begin to list their shoulds and shouldn'ts\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/13;10743;6\/st\/20091030\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/1157\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...1157\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"cdc0427@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1222516402,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211976.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":74,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cdc0427","Id":211976,"Name":"cdc0427","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"df78af7f2b073599d3fceb50faba8f11","RawContent":"Great suggestions Kelly!! I&#039;ve always wondered if those Spanish language books were worth it ~ that&#039;s why I went for the free pocketsize language guides I found online and am planning to just print those out. Besides being free, it also just keys in on the main phrases. But again the best part, it&#039;s free and ya can&#039;t beat that!!! &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":570705,"PostDate":1232802979,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Great suggestions Kelly!! I've always wondered if those Spanish language books were worth it ~ that's why I went for the free pocketsize language guides I found online and am planning to just print those out. Besides being free, it also just keys in on the main phrases. But again the best part, it's free and ya can't beat that!!! <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"msam007562@aol.com","IpAddress":"108.185.45.53","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1205833380,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208840.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":97,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MarieSam","Id":208840,"Name":"MarieSam","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":4,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eae4970e6f3f5dc0dc8d5315f0a2d172","RawContent":"have any of you done your own fun translation guides? I am American and marrying a British man and we constantly laugh at the translation issues... thought it might be cute to include a British\/English phrase book. What do you girls think?","Attachments":[],"Id":570718,"PostDate":1232810081,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                have any of you done your own fun translation guides? I am American and marrying a British man and we constantly laugh at the translation issues... thought it might be cute to include a British\/English phrase book. What do you girls think?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kelleylove@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1212942230,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209808.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kelleylove","Id":209808,"Name":"kelleylove","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"acbd6e376ca32243b3b2d4d227008fce","RawContent":"Thanks for the heads up, just making my list now and this sure helps with some of the decisions","Attachments":[],"Id":570759,"PostDate":1232824666,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks for the heads up, just making my list now and this sure helps with some of the decisions\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>July 8, 2011, Couples Sans Souci Ocho Rios, Jamaica<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"chriswin441@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1224290489,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212304.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sunstarsmoon","Id":212304,"Name":"sunstarsmoon","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bdc632c0c9c71c95d1a40d0cd509af21","RawContent":"I agree this is good info to have, I hope more people post their results as well. :)\n I am really interested to know if guests enjoyed\/ used the travel mugs as they are one of the more expensive items I was planning on putting in the bags! Thanks Kelly!","Attachments":[],"Id":570766,"PostDate":1232826158,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I agree this is good info to have, I hope more people post their results as well. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br \/> I am really interested to know if guests enjoyed\/ used the travel mugs as they are one of the more expensive items I was planning on putting in the bags! Thanks Kelly!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nikolgeiger@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1232425568,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-214124.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"maymeliabride","Id":214124,"Name":"maymeliabride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"527574ae9126da26a43744cb2da9a70e","RawContent":"Great thread, good to know!!\n I had my doubts about a few of those items and I think you answered them for me.","Attachments":[],"Id":570768,"PostDate":1232826804,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Great thread, good to know!!<br \/> I had my doubts about a few of those items and I think you answered them for me.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"spipilas@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1206480252,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208915.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DWbride09","Id":208915,"Name":"DWbride09","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":5,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e374d6bcd20897420921e8aa1adad8ab","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;KLC77&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;So, I thought it might be helpful for people who are putting together their OOT bags to know some of the things that people liked in mine and what they didn&#039;t really use.\n \n \n My bags had a lot of different stuff in them. The things that people used most and were really excited for were:\n \n Decks of cards (a last minute addition that I&#039;m glad I put in)~ it was cloudy for several days and these came in handy\n First Aid Kits~ the bandaids were good for people who got blisters\n and the Pepto bismol tablets and Motrin\n \n I also would&#039;ve added twice as many Motrins to the bags. I put in the 99 cent packs that had a total of 6 tablets in them. People used them and probably could&#039;ve used more.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;maymeliabride&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I agree this is good info to have, I hope more people post their results as well. :)\n I am really interested to know if guests enjoyed\/ used the travel mugs as they are one of the more expensive items I was planning on putting in the bags! Thanks Kelly!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;My big hits:\n The deck of cards\n First aid kit which had packets of Tylenol, Motrin, &amp;amp; Immodium, Purell hand wipes, &amp;amp; chapstick\n Flip flops for both men &amp;amp; women\n The mini-wallet\/purse used as a key card holder or for money\n The pashminas-the women loved them, especially for late nights in the lobby, on the beach &amp;amp; in restaurants for dinner.\n And yes, the travel mug was the biggest hit by far! Everywhere we went on the resort, my guests had their mugs. It was very convienent and well used at the bar!\n \n The only thing that I second guess is the use of the monogrammed canvas tote as the OOT bag itself.\n While I loved it &amp;amp; will certainly use it again &amp;amp; again, I wonder who else will really use it again, with the exception of my mother! While it made for a great beach bag as I did see my guests using it on the beach or on our shopping tours, I&#039;d still love to know if it will get used this summer by anyone else. Maybe I should have gone with the personalized paper gift bag or god forbid, skipped putting my monogram on it &amp;amp; just gone with a generic Jamaica design.\n Just food for thought for you brides to be!","Attachments":[],"Id":570793,"PostDate":1232829481,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>KLC77<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">So, I thought it might be helpful for people who are putting together their OOT bags to know some of the things that people liked in mine and what they didn't really use.<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> My bags had a lot of different stuff in them. The things that people used most and were really excited for were:<br \/> <br \/> Decks of cards (a last minute addition that I'm glad I put in)~ it was cloudy for several days and these came in handy<br \/> First Aid Kits~ the bandaids were good for people who got blisters<br \/> and the Pepto bismol tablets and Motrin<br \/> <br \/> I also would've added twice as many Motrins to the bags. I put in the 99 cent packs that had a total of 6 tablets in them. People used them and probably could've used more.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div><div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>maymeliabride<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I agree this is good info to have, I hope more people post their results as well. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br \/> I am really interested to know if guests enjoyed\/ used the travel mugs as they are one of the more expensive items I was planning on putting in the bags! Thanks Kelly!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>My big hits:<br \/> The deck of cards<br \/> First aid kit which had packets of Tylenol, Motrin, & Immodium, Purell hand wipes, & chapstick<br \/> Flip flops for both men & women<br \/> The mini-wallet\/purse used as a key card holder or for money<br \/> The pashminas-the women loved them, especially for late nights in the lobby, on the beach & in restaurants for dinner.<br \/> And yes, the travel mug was the biggest hit by far! Everywhere we went on the resort, my guests had their mugs. It was very convienent and well used at the bar!<br \/> <br \/> The only thing that I second guess is the use of the monogrammed canvas tote as the OOT bag itself.<br \/> While I loved it & will certainly use it again & again, I wonder who else will really use it again, with the exception of my mother! While it made for a great beach bag as I did see my guests using it on the beach or on our shopping tours, I'd still love to know if it will get used this summer by anyone else. Maybe I should have gone with the personalized paper gift bag or god forbid, skipped putting my monogram on it & just gone with a generic Jamaica design.<br \/> Just food for thought for you brides to be!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yvega98@aol.com","IpAddress":"71.167.150.138","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1188419100,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207685.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JUSTUSTWO","Id":207685,"Name":"JUSTUSTWO","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"337ece78a2e0b822c6a6b5ead45795eb","RawContent":"in the same place as the spanish for dummies I found drinks for dummies. They have about 25 different drinks and how to make them my guests are excited for them to take up to the bar and try out new drinks!! so just a thought since the spanish wasn&#039;t a big hit.","Attachments":[],"Id":570795,"PostDate":1232829523,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                in the same place as the spanish for dummies I found drinks for dummies. They have about 25 different drinks and how to make them my guests are excited for them to take up to the bar and try out new drinks!! so just a thought since the spanish wasn't a big hit.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jenny_ferball@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1215256013,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210331.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jennyatk","Id":210331,"Name":"jennyatk","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0e51ab16b284e933bd709caa76e1460c","RawContent":"This is a really helpful thread!!!! Thanks for posting!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":570797,"PostDate":1232829664,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                This is a really helpful thread!!!! Thanks for posting!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/img.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/ks6adri0g.png\">http:\/\/img.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/ks6adri0g.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"danniellou@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1215655971,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210436.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Danniellou","Id":210436,"Name":"Danniellou","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"29980","Title":"My OOT Bags~ the big hits and the things that weren't used","LastPostDate":1432608780},"Pages":{"TotalItems":1231,"TotalPages":124,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":1230},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
