Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.234.116.105","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78829,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bd870f2cd1b3dc6011027c150ed70cd4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;So I think I&#039;m making some progress.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m not going to keep talking about it until I actually pick a resort, because my mind has changed about 15x.&amp;nbsp; The problem I&#039;m having currently is not being able to get prices for April 2016.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1888593,"PostDate":1425652486,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>So I think I'm making some progress.\u00a0 I'm not going to keep talking about it until I actually pick a resort, because my mind has changed about 15x.\u00a0 The problem I'm having currently is not being able to get prices for April 2016.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"joanne.aguiar@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.234.116.105","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424038909,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282128.jpg?_r=1426731614","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":114,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JoannaBanana","Id":282128,"Name":"JoannaBanana","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78829,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"016fa0d5c4aa56974128cc1f71074af0","RawContent":"[quote name=\"JoannaBanana\" post=\"1888593\" timestamp=\"1425670486\"]\nSo I think I&#039;m making some progress.  I&#039;m not going to keep talking about it until I actually pick a resort, because my mind has changed about 15x.  The problem I&#039;m having currently is not being able to get prices for April 2016.[\/quote]\nYou shouldn&#039;t have much problems now, should you? I got prices in April 2014 for January to May 2015.","Attachments":[],"Id":1888639,"PostDate":1425672481,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>JoannaBanana, on 06 March 2015 - 02:34 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>So I think I'm making some progress.\u00a0 I'm not going to keep talking about it until I actually pick a resort, because my mind has changed about 15x.\u00a0 The problem I'm having currently is not being able to get prices for April 2016.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You shouldn't have much problems now, should you? I got prices in April 2014 for January to May 2015.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399410602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.186.135.100","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78829,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ceb718fda7ff15433493f48169e159cd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;This is up for debate.&amp;nbsp; Some say yes, some say no.&amp;nbsp; Still working on this.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1888807,"PostDate":1425923364,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>This is up for debate.\u00a0 Some say yes, some say no.\u00a0 Still working on this.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"joanne.aguiar@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.234.116.105","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424038909,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282128.jpg?_r=1426731614","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":114,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JoannaBanana","Id":282128,"Name":"JoannaBanana","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.186.135.100","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78829,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"29ab41c4b6e39a233df7ec47942df010","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;So I&#039;m having the opposite problem that most people have with Travel Agents.&amp;nbsp; I heard how it was hard&amp;nbsp;to get a good TA so I messaged quite a few.&amp;nbsp; Some did indeed bomb.&amp;nbsp; But now I had 2-3 who are just the sweetest thing, and I feel like such a tire kicker knowing that I have to say no to two of them eventually.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1889487,"PostDate":1426527035,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>So I'm having the opposite problem that most people have with Travel Agents.\u00a0 I heard how it was hard\u00a0to get a good TA so I messaged quite a few.\u00a0 Some did indeed bomb.\u00a0 But now I had 2-3 who are just the sweetest thing, and I feel like such a tire kicker knowing that I have to say no to two of them eventually.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"joanne.aguiar@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.234.116.105","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424038909,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282128.jpg?_r=1426731614","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":114,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JoannaBanana","Id":282128,"Name":"JoannaBanana","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.186.135.100","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78829,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1426529827,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ac35064a200321663b83047c21fd335d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;So I missed page 3 entirely&amp;nbsp;I think where you guys all had an exchange about the colour orange!&amp;nbsp; I&#039;ve pretty much committed to that colour.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m debating the other colours, but I know my bouquet will be orange and white.  &lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;EDIT: It&#039;s impossible to post pictures from my work computer, it&#039;s funky with message boards.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1889496,"PostDate":1426529596,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>So I missed page 3 entirely\u00a0I think where you guys all had an exchange about the colour orange!\u00a0 I've pretty much committed to that colour.\u00a0 I'm debating the other colours, but I know my bouquet will be orange and white.\u00a0\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>EDIT: It's impossible to post pictures from my work computer, it's funky with message boards.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"joanne.aguiar@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.234.116.105","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424038909,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282128.jpg?_r=1426731614","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":114,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JoannaBanana","Id":282128,"Name":"JoannaBanana","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78829,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c80084fd8b8e3155a155303eddaf90fa","RawContent":"[quote name=\"JoannaBanana\" post=\"1889487\" timestamp=\"1426545035\"]\nSo I&#039;m having the opposite problem that most people have with Travel Agents.  I heard how it was hard to get a good TA so I messaged quite a few.  Some did indeed bomb.  But now I had 2-3 who are just the sweetest thing, and I feel like such a tire kicker knowing that I have to say no to two of them eventually.[\/quote]I&#039;d pick one ASAP and advise the others. It&#039;s a lot of work to not get your business. Just to be fair to them. Maybe that&#039;s to sweet of me hehe. \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1889500,"PostDate":1426529792,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>JoannaBanana, on 16 March 2015 - 05:30 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>So I'm having the opposite problem that most people have with Travel Agents.  I heard how it was hard to get a good TA so I messaged quite a few.  Some did indeed bomb.  But now I had 2-3 who are just the sweetest thing, and I feel like such a tire kicker knowing that I have to say no to two of them eventually.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nI'd pick one ASAP and advise the others. It's a lot of work to not get your business. Just to be fair to them. Maybe that's to sweet of me hehe. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399410602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.186.135.100","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78829,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2422fcf1fd655804e73d068ce1a02df1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Ya, I just&amp;nbsp;got off the phone with my mother&amp;nbsp;and she told me it&#039;s \"the name of the game\"&amp;nbsp;when I said I felt bad about the TAs.&amp;nbsp; I have a bleeding heart though, I&amp;nbsp;generally always care what people feel.&amp;nbsp; Regardless, I think I&#039;m very close to the decision.&amp;nbsp; I intend to try to get an answer out of him tomorrow when we come home from the bar after St P&#039;s.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;ll let you know how it goes!&amp;nbsp; I will of course re-confirm when he&#039;s sober.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1889503,"PostDate":1426530037,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Ya, I just\u00a0got off the phone with my mother\u00a0and she told me it's \"the name of the game\"\u00a0when I said I felt bad about the TAs.\u00a0 I have a bleeding heart though, I\u00a0generally always care what people feel.\u00a0 Regardless, I think I'm very close to the decision.\u00a0 I intend to try to get an answer out of him tomorrow when we come home from the bar after St P's.\u00a0 I'll let you know how it goes!\u00a0 I will of course re-confirm when he's sober.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"joanne.aguiar@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.234.116.105","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424038909,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282128.jpg?_r=1426731614","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":114,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JoannaBanana","Id":282128,"Name":"JoannaBanana","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78829,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1426530388,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"32beef625e63f5863b870eaf6737cb1b","RawContent":"I just know how much work they put in so if you know you only intend to use one, I would feel bad to drag it out. That&#039;s all. Of course it&#039;s name of the game. I just wouldn&#039;t get them doing months and months work for nothing :) \n\n\nAnd of course this is none of my business lol you do need to feel confidence in the one you choose. \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1889506,"PostDate":1426530330,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I just know how much work they put in so if you know you only intend to use one, I would feel bad to drag it out. That's all. Of course it's name of the game. I just wouldn't get them doing months and months work for nothing <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <br><br>\nAnd of course this is none of my business lol you do need to feel confidence in the one you choose. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399410602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.56.210.194","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78829,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f70cbebe1517fb86957b233b8d5027fe","RawContent":"Great story! I loved that you shared some of your favorite songs, I just listened to them all! Thanks for sharing!","Attachments":[],"Id":1889515,"PostDate":1426533796,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Great story! I loved that you shared some of your favorite songs, I just listened to them all! Thanks for sharing!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cathyr99@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"107.201.33.67","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1412548251,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280304.jpg?_r=1412569727","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":281,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"palmtree99","Id":280304,"Name":"palmtree99","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.234.116.105","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78829,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c8b51a81b8806da60379c84ab5e77896","RawContent":"[quote name=\"calgarybride2015\" post=\"1889506\" timestamp=\"1426548330\"]\nI just wouldn&#039;t get them doing months and months work for nothing :) \n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk[\/quote]That definitely hasn&#039;t happened.  I have gotten quotes\/recommendations from three.   Then specific resort group rates from two.  I&#039;m about to make my choice so that will be the end of the line.   It just sucks because they are both nice.  Can&#039;t use them both though.\n[quote name=\"palmtree99\" post=\"1889515\" timestamp=\"1426551796\"]\nGreat story! I loved that you shared some of your favorite songs, I just listened to them all! Thanks for sharing![\/quote]Thanks lady, I was kinda doubting that I included so many songs.  I&#039;m glad even one person enjoyed listening!","Attachments":[],"Id":1889516,"PostDate":1426534702,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br><br><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>calgarybride2015, on 16 March 2015 - 06:25 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I just wouldn't get them doing months and months work for nothing <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nThat definitely hasn't happened.  I have gotten quotes\/recommendations from three.   Then specific resort group rates from two.  I'm about to make my choice so that will be the end of the line.   It just sucks because they are both nice.  Can't use them both though.<br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>palmtree99, on 16 March 2015 - 07:23 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Great story! I loved that you shared some of your favorite songs, I just listened to them all! Thanks for sharing!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\nThanks lady, I was kinda doubting that I included so many songs.  I'm glad even one person enjoyed listening!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"joanne.aguiar@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.234.116.105","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424038909,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282128.jpg?_r=1426731614","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":114,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JoannaBanana","Id":282128,"Name":"JoannaBanana","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":74,"TotalPages":8,"CurrentPage":30,"NextPage":40,"PreviousPage":20,"LastPage":70},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
