{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":6,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":47,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1898994,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":282128,"Name":"JoannaBanana","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282128.jpg?_r=1426731614","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":114,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1434907169,"LastPoster":{"Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":2,"Preview":{"Id":1898994,"PostDate":1434907169,"PostContent":"I just returned from a trip to Tulum, in the Riviera Maya area of Mexico.\u00a0 The first 2-3 days of...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"joanne.aguiar@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.234.116.105","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424038909,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282128.jpg?_r=1426731614","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":114,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JoannaBanana","Id":282128,"Name":"JoannaBanana","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.234.116.105","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79300,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5a47b84ed65debc5d66b6220dfaaaa0c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I just returned from a trip to Tulum, in the Riviera Maya area of Mexico.&amp;nbsp; The first 2-3 days of my trip gave us a lot of rain, and time to find answers to my questions about \"What the heck is going on with all the seaweed on the beach?\"&amp;nbsp; I learned a lot, so I thought I would share.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I have traveled to Mexico before.&amp;nbsp; I have stayed in Neuvo Vallarta (other coast), Cancun maybe four times, and one of those times I stayed in Playa del Carmen for a couple of nights.&amp;nbsp; I thought I knew what to expect.&amp;nbsp; I heard this year was bad for seaweed, but I didn&#039;t expect it to be THIS bad.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i.imgur.com\/xeNab1el.jpg\" alt=\"xeNab1el.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i.imgur.com\/AsU8RRpl.jpg\" alt=\"AsU8RRpl.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;There was a lot of hearsay going around the resort.&amp;nbsp; It&#039;s the weather (tropical storm), it&#039;s global warming, it&#039;s an oil spill that changed the balance in the water.&amp;nbsp; In the end, when I looked online it seems that no one claims to completely understand the phenomenon, but it&#039;s agreed that the contributing factors are the unusually warm weather over the past year in the region, wind patterns, and sea currents.&amp;nbsp; The weed originates in the Sargasso Sea and is affecting many of the beaches in the Caribbean floating in as great blankets of weed.&amp;nbsp; Whether this is a \"one off\" or a cyclical event to be expected in future remains to be seen.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/www.windows2universe.org\/spaceweather\/images\/Sargasso_map.jpg\" alt=\"Sargasso_map.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;How this affects you the traveller?&amp;nbsp; Well I guess this depends on which resort you are staying at, where it&#039;s located geographically, and what measures they are taking to clean it up.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;ve heard reports of some resorts using tractors to rake up the beach.&amp;nbsp; Others they shovel by hand.&amp;nbsp; And others simply choose to leave it as it stands.&amp;nbsp; At my resort there was a rumor that they were doing it by hand due to the number of turtle nests which they did not want to disturb.&amp;nbsp; Sadly, this week also causes the baby turtles to have an increasingly difficult time reaching the ocean waters in the areas where it is more dramatically affected.&amp;nbsp; Some marine life is affected negatively, and some positively.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Where I stayed (Grand Bahia Principe Tulum) the beach was basically unusable.&amp;nbsp; If you did want to go in to the ocean you would have to walk across about 20 feet of weeds, which were stacked about 3 feet high.&amp;nbsp; On an overcast day (where the beach was not busy) we walked a little down to what we were soon to find out was the Privilege Club.&amp;nbsp; As we tried to walk through the very small opening in the sargassum we were asked to turn around and go back to our assigned beach.&amp;nbsp; We argued that we didn&#039;t want to walk through the weeds and we were gracefully given our requested 5 minutes in the water.&amp;nbsp; We got in about knee deep and turned around and went back to the pool where we stayed for most of the week.&amp;nbsp; Near the end we decided to get on a trolly and visit our sister resort Grand Bahia Principe Akumal.&amp;nbsp; This area was cleared a little but more, but it was an uphill battle.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If you are a pool person, you probably don&#039;t even need to consider this, but your guests may be.&amp;nbsp; I would actively look at recent beach photos from the resort you are considering if you are still in the choosing stages.&amp;nbsp; Some are probably AOK, where others may be suffering.&amp;nbsp; Weigh it in to your decision, because even knowing it was a bad year for seaweed, I was pretty disappointed.&amp;nbsp; Does it ruin your vacation?&amp;nbsp; No. Could it change your decision?&amp;nbsp; Maybe.&amp;nbsp; It might change mine.   No one really knows how long this is going to go on.&amp;nbsp; I imagine the resorts figure out ways to adapt.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I feel like I just wrote a 6th grade speech, but I really just wanted to share this information with my fellow brides.&amp;nbsp; Hot tip:&amp;nbsp; It&#039;s really fun to pop the berries, and the seaweed isn&#039;t slimy (though a little bit stinky).&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898994,"PostDate":1434907169,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I just returned from a trip to Tulum, in the Riviera Maya area of Mexico.\u00a0 The first 2-3 days of my trip gave us a lot of rain, and time to find answers to my questions about \"What the heck is going on with all the seaweed on the beach?\"\u00a0 I learned a lot, so I thought I would share.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have traveled to Mexico before.\u00a0 I have stayed in Neuvo Vallarta (other coast), Cancun maybe four times, and one of those times I stayed in Playa del Carmen for a couple of nights.\u00a0 I thought I knew what to expect.\u00a0 I heard this year was bad for seaweed, but I didn't expect it to be THIS bad.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i.imgur.com\/xeNab1el.jpg\" alt=\"xeNab1el.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i.imgur.com\/AsU8RRpl.jpg\" alt=\"AsU8RRpl.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>There was a lot of hearsay going around the resort.\u00a0 It's the weather (tropical storm), it's global warming, it's an oil spill that changed the balance in the water.\u00a0 In the end, when I looked online it seems that no one claims to completely understand the phenomenon, but it's agreed that the contributing factors are the unusually warm weather over the past year in the region, wind patterns, and sea currents.\u00a0 The weed originates in the Sargasso Sea and is affecting many of the beaches in the Caribbean floating in as great blankets of weed.\u00a0 Whether this is a \"one off\" or a cyclical event to be expected in future remains to be seen.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/www.windows2universe.org\/spaceweather\/images\/Sargasso_map.jpg\" alt=\"Sargasso_map.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>How this affects you the traveller?\u00a0 Well I guess this depends on which resort you are staying at, where it's located geographically, and what measures they are taking to clean it up.\u00a0 I've heard reports of some resorts using tractors to rake up the beach.\u00a0 Others they shovel by hand.\u00a0 And others simply choose to leave it as it stands.\u00a0 At my resort there was a rumor that they were doing it by hand due to the number of turtle nests which they did not want to disturb.\u00a0 Sadly, this week also causes the baby turtles to have an increasingly difficult time reaching the ocean waters in the areas where it is more dramatically affected.\u00a0 Some marine life is affected negatively, and some positively.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Where I stayed (Grand Bahia Principe Tulum) the beach was basically unusable.\u00a0 If you did want to go in to the ocean you would have to walk across about 20 feet of weeds, which were stacked about 3 feet high.\u00a0 On an overcast day (where the beach was not busy) we walked a little down to what we were soon to find out was the Privilege Club.\u00a0 As we tried to walk through the very small opening in the sargassum we were asked to turn around and go back to our assigned beach.\u00a0 We argued that we didn't want to walk through the weeds and we were gracefully given our requested 5 minutes in the water.\u00a0 We got in about knee deep and turned around and went back to the pool where we stayed for most of the week.\u00a0 Near the end we decided to get on a trolly and visit our sister resort Grand Bahia Principe Akumal.\u00a0 This area was cleared a little but more, but it was an uphill battle.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If you are a pool person, you probably don't even need to consider this, but your guests may be.\u00a0 I would actively look at recent beach photos from the resort you are considering if you are still in the choosing stages.\u00a0 Some are probably AOK, where others may be suffering.\u00a0 Weigh it in to your decision, because even knowing it was a bad year for seaweed, I was pretty disappointed.\u00a0 Does it ruin your vacation?\u00a0 No. Could it change your decision?\u00a0 Maybe.\u00a0 It might change mine.\u00a0\u00a0 No one really knows how long this is going to go on.\u00a0 I imagine the resorts figure out ways to adapt.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I feel like I just wrote a 6th grade speech, but I really just wanted to share this information with my fellow brides.\u00a0 Hot tip:\u00a0 It's really fun to pop the berries, and the seaweed isn't slimy (though a little bit stinky).\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"joanne.aguiar@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.234.116.105","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424038909,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282128.jpg?_r=1426731614","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":114,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JoannaBanana","Id":282128,"Name":"JoannaBanana","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79300,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by vancouverpetunia, Today, 05:37 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1434908267,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"399c4f6e964d73072af224dfe57c594f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Haha! 6th grade science report, I&#039;d say. Thanks for doing the research and reporting on it. I&#039;m not a beach person and so didn&#039;t even think to take a good look at the beach when we did a site visit at our resort in April (we were only there for a couple of hours)&amp;nbsp; :huh:  Luckily when I look at the photos I took with the beach in the background, it looks fine. Although that may have changed...&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898996,"PostDate":1434908232,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Haha! 6th grade science report, I'd say. Thanks for doing the research and reporting on it. I'm not a beach person and so didn't even think to take a good look at the beach when we did a site visit at our resort in April (we were only there for a couple of hours)\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/huh.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':huh:' \/>\u00a0\u00a0Luckily when I look at the photos I took with the beach in the background, it looks fine. Although that may have changed...<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>- Erin<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268<\/a>","Email":"ekjzwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1417431445,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vancouverpetunia","Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.126.252.6","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79300,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"62672e410f1a1d7ccefe24565fad1fd2","RawContent":"Thanks for the info!! \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1899000,"PostDate":1434912103,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks for the info!! <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359745104,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.146.146.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79300,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"df557866c239f1a496497aa596aae3cf","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Blows my mind!! &amp;nbsp;Did you take any pics of it at GS? I have some random pics from January that show that the beach where you entered the water was fine, but off towards to the spa there was some. But nothing like that! &amp;nbsp;I think it must be worse now than before.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1899005,"PostDate":1434913830,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Blows my mind!! \u00a0Did you take any pics of it at GS? I have some random pics from January that show that the beach where you entered the water was fine, but off towards to the spa there was some. But nothing like that! \u00a0I think it must be worse now than before.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399410602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.234.116.105","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79300,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"82cf546a46c89902ae2c15dff3ffbea7","RawContent":"@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] No!  That&#039;s the one thing we were kicking ourselves about with the site tour is that we didn&#039;t take enough pictures.  We took a couple of the lobby pretty much and then got so swept up with our tour that we totally forgot.  There IS seaweed at Sirenis, but dramatically less.  I&#039;m not sure if  location, or protection from the rocks...  But it was way less, and easier to get around it.  I think it must vary dramatically resort to resort.","Attachments":[],"Id":1899007,"PostDate":1434915313,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a> No!  That's the one thing we were kicking ourselves about with the site tour is that we didn't take enough pictures.  We took a couple of the lobby pretty much and then got so swept up with our tour that we totally forgot.  There IS seaweed at Sirenis, but dramatically less.  I'm not sure if  location, or protection from the rocks...  But it was way less, and easier to get around it.  I think it must vary dramatically resort to resort.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"joanne.aguiar@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.234.116.105","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424038909,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282128.jpg?_r=1426731614","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":114,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JoannaBanana","Id":282128,"Name":"JoannaBanana","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.146.146.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79300,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"df2ffbb70be7ee7aca95404c3444f8aa","RawContent":"The nice thing, wedding wise, about the GS is that if you use the private beach the rocks are all there so the seaweed can&#039;t get up on the sand where the ceremony would be :)\n\n\nIt&#039;s a pretty resort and modern!  I may have some pics if there was something specific you wanted to see again!\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1899008,"PostDate":1434915572,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                The nice thing, wedding wise, about the GS is that if you use the private beach the rocks are all there so the seaweed can't get up on the sand where the ceremony would be <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br>\nIt's a pretty resort and modern!  I may have some pics if there was something specific you wanted to see again!<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399410602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}}],"Id":"79300","Title":"Sargassum - The Seaweed Phenomenon","LastPostDate":1434915572},"Pages":{"TotalItems":6,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
