{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"104.162.221.122","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79298,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"517122c9225d694c5b2546d480ff6d41","RawContent":"&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Hi:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;My fiance and I got engaged in October and we are planning a July 2016 destination wedding. &amp;nbsp;I am new to this and have no experience with event planning, let alone destination planning. &amp;nbsp;My primary concern is finding a venue. &amp;nbsp;We are planning on having approximately 30 guests and I would greatly appreciate any suggestions. &amp;nbsp;Below is what I&#039;m looking for:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;- anywhere in Mexico or the Carribbean (in reasonable distance from both NY and CA)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;- small, boutique resort with 100 rooms or less&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;- non-touristy location (I&#039;m not interested in hotels located among strips of other hotels)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;- beach-front hotel&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;- preferably with villas for some guests (i.e., beachfront standalone villa with direct access to the beach from the room)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Any suggestions greatly appreciated.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;My secondary concern is finding a travel agent. &amp;nbsp;I&#039;ve read that I should have all guests book through one travel agent. &amp;nbsp;But, I have no idea how to find one or where to even begin my search. &amp;nbsp;I am in NYC, if that matters. &amp;nbsp;Again, any suggestions or places to start are most welcome.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Thanks everyone.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898947,"PostDate":1434821574,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Hi:<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">My fiance and I got engaged in October and we are planning a July 2016 destination wedding. \u00a0I am new to this and have no experience with event planning, let alone destination planning. \u00a0My primary concern is finding a venue. \u00a0We are planning on having approximately 30 guests and I would greatly appreciate any suggestions. \u00a0Below is what I'm looking for:<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">- anywhere in Mexico or the Carribbean (in reasonable distance from both NY and CA)<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">- small, boutique resort with 100 rooms or less<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">- non-touristy location (I'm not interested in hotels located among strips of other hotels)<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">- beach-front hotel<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">- preferably with villas for some guests (i.e., beachfront standalone villa with direct access to the beach from the room)<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Any suggestions greatly appreciated.<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">My secondary concern is finding a travel agent. \u00a0I've read that I should have all guests book through one travel agent. \u00a0But, I have no idea how to find one or where to even begin my search. \u00a0I am in NYC, if that matters. \u00a0Again, any suggestions or places to start are most welcome.<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Thanks everyone.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"becky2285@aol.com","IpAddress":"104.162.221.122","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1434819981,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"rebecca2122","Id":283625,"Name":"rebecca2122","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":1,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
