Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"104.162.221.122","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79297,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"54819d76744c9f3f5c68a3bfdf505ff4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My fiance and I got engaged in October and we are planning a July 2016 destination wedding. &amp;nbsp;I am new to this and have no experience with event planning, let alone destination planning. &amp;nbsp;My primary concern is finding a venue. &amp;nbsp;We are planning on having approximately 30 guests and I would greatly appreciate any suggestions. &amp;nbsp;Below is what I&#039;m looking for:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- anywhere in Mexico or the Carribbean (in reasonable distance from both NY and CA)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- small, boutique resort with 100 rooms or less&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- non-touristy location (I&#039;m not interested in hotels located among strips of other hotels)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- beach-front hotel&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- preferably with villas for some guests (i.e., beachfront standalone villa with direct access to the beach from the room)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Any suggestions greatly appreciated.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My secondary concern is finding a travel agent. &amp;nbsp;I&#039;ve read that I should have all guests book through one travel agent. &amp;nbsp;But, I have no idea how to find one or where to even begin my search. &amp;nbsp;I am in NYC, if that matters. &amp;nbsp;Again, any suggestions or places to start are most welcome.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks everyone.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898946,"PostDate":1434821015,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My fiance and I got engaged in October and we are planning a July 2016 destination wedding. \u00a0I am new to this and have no experience with event planning, let alone destination planning. \u00a0My primary concern is finding a venue. \u00a0We are planning on having approximately 30 guests and I would greatly appreciate any suggestions. \u00a0Below is what I'm looking for:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>- anywhere in Mexico or the Carribbean (in reasonable distance from both NY and CA)<\/p>\n<p>- small, boutique resort with 100 rooms or less<\/p>\n<p>- non-touristy location (I'm not interested in hotels located among strips of other hotels)<\/p>\n<p>- beach-front hotel<\/p>\n<p>- preferably with villas for some guests (i.e., beachfront standalone villa with direct access to the beach from the room)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Any suggestions greatly appreciated.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My secondary concern is finding a travel agent. \u00a0I've read that I should have all guests book through one travel agent. \u00a0But, I have no idea how to find one or where to even begin my search. \u00a0I am in NYC, if that matters. \u00a0Again, any suggestions or places to start are most welcome.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks everyone.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"becky2285@aol.com","IpAddress":"104.162.221.122","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1434819981,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"rebecca2122","Id":283625,"Name":"rebecca2122","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.15.187","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79297,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1434835896,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0b6f89d46788fb7c824183e3b267f251","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Rebecca,\n\n\nFirst of all congratulations and welcome to BDW!! You&#039;ve definitely come to the right place for planning information. I can almost guarantee that as far as experience I don&#039;t think there are very many of the brides to be here that have done wedding planning. I think we&#039;ve had a couple with some event planning experience but the majority are first timers just like yourself.\n\n\nThe best piece of advice I can give you is to contact the administrators of this site. They are destination wedding experts and I&#039;m sure they would be able to help you with suggestions or ideas with the criteria your looking for and they&#039;re CA based!! You can read reviews of their services here and see what other brides have had to say.\n\n\nYou can contact them through this site and I&#039;ve tried to past the link:\n\n&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/go\/destination-wedding?lp-variation-id=0&amp;amp;title=Planning%20a%20Destination%20Wedding?&amp;amp;source=BDW&amp;amp;creative=WTA%20TB&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/go\/destination-wedding?lp-variation-id=0&amp;amp;title=Planning%20a%20Destination%20Wedding?&amp;amp;source=BDW&amp;amp;creative=WTA%20TB&lt;\/a&gt;\n\n\nGood luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898949,"PostDate":1434828061,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Rebecca,<br><br>\nFirst of all congratulations and welcome to BDW!! You've definitely come to the right place for planning information. I can almost guarantee that as far as experience I don't think there are very many of the brides to be here that have done wedding planning. I think we've had a couple with some event planning experience but the majority are first timers just like yourself.<br><br>\nThe best piece of advice I can give you is to contact the administrators of this site. They are destination wedding experts and I'm sure they would be able to help you with suggestions or ideas with the criteria your looking for and they're CA based!! You can read reviews of their services here and see what other brides have had to say.<br><br>\nYou can contact them through this site and I've tried to past the link:<br><br><a href='https:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/go\/destination-wedding?lp-variation-id=0&title=Planning%20a%20Destination%20Wedding?&source=BDW&creative=WTA%20TB' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.wrighttr...creative=WTA TB<\/a><br><br>\nGood luck!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283440999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79297,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"773e543b11d02432a41b3ba1da6e0cf8","RawContent":"@[member=\"rebecca2122\"] I would definitely contact a travel agent (or even a few) to have them help you narrow down the resorts based on your criteria. Also having a budget for your guests (i.e. how much per night, etc.) may help. Are you thinking all inclusive? It&#039;s important to clarify that as well (or realize that the options can be quite different if you want to consider both). Unfortunately I don&#039;t have any TA recommendations for you, but certainly the ladies here seem to be happy working with Wright Travel. There should be other TA reviews for you to check out as well. Good luck!\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\nP.S. Personally I don&#039;t think it matters where your TA is located (other than the same country). Although mine is fairly local to me, we&#039;ve never met in person and I don&#039;t think it&#039;s been an issue. \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1898954,"PostDate":1434835529,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283625\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283625-rebecca2122\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">rebecca2122<\/span><\/a> I would definitely contact a travel agent (or even a few) to have them help you narrow down the resorts based on your criteria. Also having a budget for your guests (i.e. how much per night, etc.) may help. Are you thinking all inclusive? It's important to clarify that as well (or realize that the options can be quite different if you want to consider both). Unfortunately I don't have any TA recommendations for you, but certainly the ladies here seem to be happy working with Wright Travel. There should be other TA reviews for you to check out as well. Good luck!<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<br \/>P.S. Personally I don't think it matters where your TA is located (other than the same country). Although mine is fairly local to me, we've never met in person and I don't think it's been an issue. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>- Erin<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268<\/a>","Email":"ekjzwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1417431445,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vancouverpetunia","Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":3,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
