Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"63.86.124.4","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79281,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8e325538a7362ad863dfd673199c681f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi ladies,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m hoping someone on here can help me.&amp;nbsp; I had put a deposit down on this bouquet that had starfish in it to go along with the theme of our wedding.&amp;nbsp; Long story short, I told the seller to keep my deposit...it was turning into too much of a hassle.&amp;nbsp; The hotel we are getting married at does give the choice of bouquets so I have decided to go ahead and do that since I found one I really like.&amp;nbsp; Problem is, I would like to add starfish to it.&amp;nbsp; I know on Etsy I saw starfish on a stick so that you can stick that into the flowers, and for the life of me...now I can&#039;t find it.&amp;nbsp; Anyone know where I can get these or have any DIY ideas that you think might work?&amp;nbsp; Whatever I do go with, needs to be durable to make the trip to Mexico.&amp;nbsp; TIA for any help!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Erin&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898670,"PostDate":1434455593,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi ladies,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm hoping someone on here can help me.\u00a0 I had put a deposit down on this bouquet that had starfish in it to go along with the theme of our wedding.\u00a0 Long story short, I told the seller to keep my deposit...it was turning into too much of a hassle.\u00a0 The hotel we are getting married at does give the choice of bouquets so I have decided to go ahead and do that since I found one I really like.\u00a0 Problem is, I would like to add starfish to it.\u00a0 I know on Etsy I saw starfish on a stick so that you can stick that into the flowers, and for the life of me...now I can't find it.\u00a0 Anyone know where I can get these or have any DIY ideas that you think might work?\u00a0 Whatever I do go with, needs to be durable to make the trip to Mexico.\u00a0 TIA for any help!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Erin<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"erind285@gmail.com","IpAddress":"63.86.124.4","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411105603,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"RivieraBride15","Id":279902,"Name":"RivieraBride15","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.56.86.35","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79281,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e4cc8c58ef532e5bf1e341f818c77d45","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"RivieraBride15\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here are the starfish sticks. I&#039;m considering getting them too:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/ca\/listing\/204652433\/set-12-blue-white-starfish-bridal?ref=favs_view_17&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/ca\/listing\/204652433\/set-12-blue-white-starfish-bridal?ref=favs_view_17&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;and these ones:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/ca\/listing\/204576747\/ala-cart-starfish-picksstems-for-beach?ref=favs_view_18&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/ca\/listing\/204576747\/ala-cart-starfish-picksstems-for-beach?ref=favs_view_18&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I might play around with hot glue gunning some small starfish maybe onto skewer sticks or something like that. We shall see.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898678,"PostDate":1434458136,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279902\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279902-rivierabride15\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">RivieraBride15<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Here are the starfish sticks. I'm considering getting them too:<\/p>\n<p><a href='https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/ca\/listing\/204652433\/set-12-blue-white-starfish-bridal?ref=favs_view_17' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.etsy.com...ef=favs_view_17<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>and these ones:<\/p>\n<p><a href='https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/ca\/listing\/204576747\/ala-cart-starfish-picksstems-for-beach?ref=favs_view_18' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.etsy.com...ef=favs_view_18<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I might play around with hot glue gunning some small starfish maybe onto skewer sticks or something like that. We shall see.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>~*~YYCBRIDE2016~*~<\/p><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79227-yycbride2016-grand-sirenis-planning-thread-february-2016\/'>My planning thread\u00a0<\/a><\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><br><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;484\/st\/20160223\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-1\/k\/4bd8\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><br><\/a><br>\u00a0","Email":"janellepaquin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"162.157.216.37","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1432083304,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283167.jpg?_r=1432133572","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"yycbride2016","Id":283167,"Name":"yycbride2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.87.237.201","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79281,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"48d14b5aa3b5e9848655222a237a4b17","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Oh my gosh those are so pretty!!!!! Now you&#039;re giving me ideas! lol I think that&#039;s a really beautiful thing to be able to add!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898697,"PostDate":1434469100,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>O